		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Mega Charizard Y flies high and quickly launches a flame storm on enemies in a column, inflicting#C0x3D8A99#290% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#and applying 2 layers of [Burn] to all enemies for 2 rounds. Inflicting 15% [Fire Vulnerability] to burned enemies for 2 rounds. (Fire Vulnerability: Negative effect, increases damage taken from Fire-Type skills and burn effect); and extend the Burn effect for 1 round",
