		describe_th = "Mega Pidgeot fly to the sky and summons the storm tornado to attack the single enemy Pokemon,dealing #C0x3D8A99#460%SP.ATK #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$#C0xF13B54# SP.DMG #C0x5B545B#.Then consumes all the [Wind] to revert into wind razor, every wind razor dealing additional #C0x3D8A99#100% SP.ATK #C0x5B545B# true damage.If this attack consumes 3 stacks of the [Wind], it will enter to the [hovering] state for 2 rounds.\n#F10#\n#F40#[hovering]: special effect, can not be selected",
		starEffectDesc_en = "additional effect: when the target is still alive after the Ultimate skill, it will take the target to the sky, making target enter the [remain airborne] state for 1 round.\n#F10#\n#F40# [remain airborne]: special control effect,can't be selected and move, receive the SP. DMG of the amount of 30% lost HP when it lands(without exceeding Mega Pidgeot's 500% SP.ATK)",
		id = 543
	},
	[546] = {
		describe_id = "Setiap kali bergerak, ia akan memperoleh [wind] selama 2 ronde\n#F10#\n#F40#[wind]: ditumpuk hingga 3 kali, setiap tumpukan meningkatkan bonus DMG sendiri sebesar 20% dan meningkatkan semua terbang sekutu- ketik Pokemon #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#kecepatan. Saat diserang secara aktif, setiap tumpukan [wind] menurunkan 10% DMG",
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = "efeito adicional: No início da batalha, ganha 1 pilha de [wind]. se o aliado tiver 3 ou mais Pokémon do tipo voador, ele ganhará mais 1 pilha de [wind]. Ao atacar ativamente, se sua velocidade for maior que a do alvo principal, este ataque causará dano verdadeiro e o DMG aumentará em 30%",
		describe_vn = "Cada vez que ele se move, ele ganha [wind] por 2 rodadas\n#F10#\n#F40#[wind]: acumula até 3 vezes, cada pilha aumenta o próprio bônus de DMG em 20% e aumenta todos os vôos aliados- digite Pokémon #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#velocidade. Quando é atacado ativamente, cada pilha de [wind] diminui 10% DMG",
		starEffectDesc_id = "efek tambahan: Di awal pertempuran, jika sekutu memiliki 3 atau lebih Pokemon tipe terbang, ia akan memperoleh 1 tumpukan [wind]. Saat aktif menyerang, jika kecepatannya lebih tinggi dari target utamanya, serangan ini akan menghasilkan true damage",
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = "เอฟเฟกต์เพิ่มเติม: เมื่อเริ่มการต่อสู้ ได้รับ 1 สแต็ค [wind] หากพันธมิตรมีโปเกมอนประเภทบิน 3 ตัวขึ้นไป มันจะได้รับสแต็กเพิ่มอีก 1 [wind] เมื่อโจมตีอย่างแข็งขัน หากความเร็วของมันสูงกว่าเป้าหมายหลัก การโจมตีนี้จะสร้างความเสียหายจริงและความเสียหายเพิ่มขึ้น 30%",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "추가 효과: 전투 시작 시 아군에게 비행형 포켓몬이 3마리 이상 있으면 [wind] 1스택을 얻습니다. 적극적으로 공격할 때 주 대상보다 속도가 빠르면 이 공격은 고정 피해를 입힙니다.",
		describe_es = "Cada vez que se mueve, ganará [wind] durante 2 rondas\n#F10#\n#F40#[wind]: se acumula hasta 3 veces, cada acumulación aumenta la bonificación de DAÑO propio en un 20 % y aumenta todos los vuelos aliados. tipo Pokémon #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#velocidad. Cuando es atacado activamente, cada acumulación de [wind] disminuye un 10% de DAÑO",
