		describe_en = "Every time after it moves,it will gains [wind] for 2 rounds\n#F10#\n#F40#[wind]:stacks up to 3 times,every stack increases own DMG bonus by 20% and increases all allied flyying-type Pokemon #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#speed.When it is actively attacked,each stack of [wind] decrease 10% DMG",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970# ได้รับ 1 สแต็คของ [wind] เมื่อเริ่มการต่อสู้: เมื่อโจมตีเป้าหมายที่มีความเร็วต่ำกว่าเป้าหมาย Mega Pidgeot จะเพิ่ม DMG ของมัน 30%",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "추가 효과: 전투 시작 시 [wind] 1스택을 얻습니다. 아군이 비행형 포켓몬을 3마리 이상 보유하고 있다면 [wind]의 스택을 1개 더 얻습니다. 적극적으로 공격할 때 주 대상보다 속도가 빠르면 이 공격은 고정 피해를 입히고 피해량이 30% 증가합니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970# 전투 시작 시 [wind] 1스택을 얻습니다. 속도가 느린 대상을 공격하면 메가 피지오트의 데미지가 30% 증가합니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "additional effect: At the beginning of the battle,gains 1 stack of [wind]. if ally has 3 or more flying-type Pokemon,it will gain 1 more stack of [wind]. When actively attacking,if its speed higher then the main target, this attack will deal true damage and the DMG increases by 30%",
		describe_kr = "움직일 때마다 2라운드 동안 [wind]를 얻습니다\n#F10#\n#F40#[wind]: 최대 3번 중첩되며, 스택마다 자신의 DMG 보너스가 20% 증가하고 모든 아군 비행이 증가합니다. 유형 포켓몬 #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#속도.적극 공격을 받을 때 [wind] 스택당 데미지가 10% 감소합니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "#C0x5c9970# Ganha 1 pilha de [wind] no início da batalha: Ao atacar o alvo com velocidade menor que ela, Mega Pidgeot aumenta seu DMG em 30%",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "#C0x5c9970# Mendapat 1 tumpukan [wind] di awal pertempuran: Saat menyerang target yang kecepatannya lebih rendah darinya, Mega Pidgeot meningkatkan DMG-nya sebesar 30%",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "efeito adicional: No início da batalha, se o aliado tiver 3 ou mais Pokémon do tipo voador, ele ganhará 1 pilha de [wind]. Ao atacar ativamente, se sua velocidade for maior que a do alvo principal, este ataque causará dano real",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "#C0x5c9970# Gana 1 acumulación de [wind] al comienzo de la batalla: al atacar al objetivo que tiene una velocidad menor que él, Mega Pidgeot aumenta su daño en un 30%.",
		describe_th = "ทุกครั้งที่มันเคลื่อนที่ มันจะได้รับ [wind] เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ\n#F10#\n#F40#[wind]:สแต็คได้สูงสุด 3 ครั้ง ทุกสแต็คจะเพิ่มโบนัส DMG ของตัวเอง 20% และเพิ่มการบินของพันธมิตรทั้งหมด- พิมพ์ Pokemon #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#speed เมื่อถูกโจมตี แต่ละสแต็ค [wind] ลด DMG 10%",
