		describe_en = "Cloyster jump from the water and rolls into all enemy targets, dealing#C0xE69900#160%  P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, 80% chance of causing enemies in back row to fall into [Ice Trap] for 2 rounds. If it is already in [Ice Trap], 100% chance to [Frozen] the target for 2 rounds, and increase 100% P.DEF for 1 round, then retract into the shell and protect itself last until the next turn (the total HP of the shell is 3000% of initial P.DEF of Shellder, cannot to retract into the shell when Shellder’s HP is 0)",
