		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Mime Jr. shoots Light Ball to attack a single enemy to deal #C0x3D8A99#100%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#; And add barrier shield for itself and the allied unit which can absorb 300% damage from its own SP.DEF and P.DEF Buff for 2 rounds",
