		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970#【배리어 쉴드】 유닛 최대 3개, 【배리어 쉴드】데미지 감소 제공량이 50%로 증가",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Mr. Mime creates Phantom to attack all enemy targets in the opposing camp to deal #C0x3D8A99#100%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, and add one【Barrier Shield】for random 3 allies for 2 rounds, 【Barrier Shield】: DMG reduction increases 50%, when the target receives active skill damage, there is 50% chance to aviod this damage",
