		describe_en = "Scyther burst into high-speed and moves quickly while attacking the enemy target with the lowest HP in the back line, dealing#C0xE69900#140% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. It adds a permanent Prey Mark to the target (dealing 30% extra damage when attacking the target with Prey Mark, while bug-type allies deal extra 15% damage to the target)",
