		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "and settles the burn damage on the target again at a 20% ratio",
		describe_vn = "Magmortar reúne toda a energia dentro de si para atirar lava quente em alvos inimigos na linha de frente, distribuindo#C0x3D8A99#250% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*42)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, e desencadeia o dano total a ser infligido pelo efeito Burn (o dano total excede 1000% do seu próprio SP.ATK). Se o alvo ainda estiver vivo, ele adicionará outra pilha de Queimadura (com extra#C0xE69900#40% de SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#dano por 2 rodadas, até 5 pilhas), por 2 rodadas",
		starEffectDesc_th = "ผลกระทบเพิ่มเติม: เพิ่มขีดจำกัดความเสียหายจากการไหม้ 20%, เพิ่มสแต็คการเผาเพิ่มเติม 1 ครั้ง หากเป้าหมายไม่ถูกทำให้ล้มลง",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "Efeito adicional: Aumenta o limite de dano de queimadura em 20%, adiciona mais 1 pilha de queimadura se o alvo não for nocauteado",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "추가 효과 : 화상 데미지 한도 20% 증가, 대상이 넉아웃되지 않은 경우 화상 스택 1개 추가, 대상에 대한 화상 데미지를 20% 비율로 다시 고정",
		describe_en = "Magmortar gathers all the energy within itself to shoot hot lava at enemy targets in the front line, dealing#C0x3D8A99#250% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*42)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, and triggers the total damage to be inflicted by the Burn effect (total damage does exceed 1000% of its own SP.ATK). If the target is still alive, it will add another stack of Burn (with extra#C0xE69900#40% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#damage for 2 rounds, up to 5 stacks), for 2 rounds",
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = "Efek tambahan: Meningkatkan batas kerusakan luka bakar sebesar 20%, menambah 1 tumpukan luka bakar lagi jika target tidak tersingkir, dan menetapkan kerusakan luka bakar pada target lagi dengan rasio 20%.",
		describe_id = "Magmortar mengumpulkan seluruh energi dalam dirinya untuk menembakkan lava panas ke target musuh di garis depan, menimbulkan#C0x3D8A99#250% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*42)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, dan memicu kerusakan total terkena efek Burn (total damage melebihi 1000% SP.ATK miliknya). Jika target masih hidup, akan menambah tumpukan Burn lagi (dengan tambahan#C0xE69900#40% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#damage selama 2 ronde, hingga 5 tumpukan), selama 2 ronde",
		simDesc_en = "Magmortar gathers all the energy within itself to shoot hot flames at enemy targets in the front line, causes burning targets to explode and adds one stack to the burn effect",
