		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Kabuto shuttles between enemies and shakes the ground and summons rock spikes from the ground to attack all enemies to deal#C0xE69900#140%P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, with 50% chance to ignore target's 50% P.DEF. For every layer of bleeding on the target, increases own the chance of ignoring P.DEF by 10%, up to 100%",
