		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#ระยะการโจมตีเปลี่ยนเป็นคอลัมน์ และมี 10% [Vulnerability] เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970#공격 범위가 기둥형으로 변경되며, 2라운드 동안 10%[Vulnerability]로 변경됩니다.",
		describe_id = "Dragonite mengumpulkan kekuatan api pada cakarnya sebelum mendaratkan pukulan kuat pada satu target musuh, menyebabkan#C0xE69900#220% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, dengan efek [Burn] untuk 2 putaran. (Bakar: Sebelum memulai setiap putaran, target kehilangan kerusakan setara dengan 30% P.ATK Dragonite, hingga 5 tumpukan), jika memiliki efek negatif atau kondisi status pada target, gandakan kerusakan serangan ini dan tambahkan tambahan [Burning]",
		simDesc_en = "Dragonite gathers fire power on its claws before landing a powerful uppercut on a single enemy target",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Dragonite gathers fire power on its claws before landing a powerful uppercut on a column enemy target, dealing#C0xE69900#220% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, with [Burn] effect for 2 rounds. (Burn: Before the start of each round, the target loses damage equals to Dragonite's 30% P.ATK, up to 5 stacks) and [Vulnerability] for 2 rounds(damage taken is increased by extra 10%) If the target has a negative or control effect, doubles the damage of this attack and adds an additional [Burn]",
		describe_kr = "Dragonite는 발톱에 화력을 모아 단일 적 대상에게 강력한 어퍼컷을 날립니다. #C0xE69900#220% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, [Burn] 효과 2라운드. (번 : 매 라운드 시작 전, 대상은 Dragonite의 P.ATK 30%만큼 피해를 입음, 최대 5중첩), 대상에게 부정적인 효과나 상태이상이 있을 경우, 이 공격의 피해가 두 배로 증가하고 추가로 추가됩니다. [Burning]",
		simDesc_th = "Dragonite รวบรวมพลังไฟจากกรงเล็บของมัน ก่อนที่จะโจมตีศัตรูตัวฉกาจอันทรงพลังไปยังเป้าหมายเดียว",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "#C0x5c9970#O alcance do ataque foi alterado para uma coluna, e com 10% [Vulnerability] por 2 rodadas",
