		starEffectDesc_en = "Additional effect: There is a 100% chance of gaining 20% Vulnerability, Burn, and Paralysis for 2 rounds before dealing damage; +15% Crit DMG of this one-hit move for every negative or control effect the target receives (capped at 200%)",
