		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Ampharos gathers an electric ball and ignites it to attack enemies in a row, dealing#C0x3D8A99#220% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, with 100% chance of inflicting [Electrify] on its target for 2 rounds. It also recovers 100 rage points for its allies, and electric-type Pokémons will receive extra 100 rage points.",
