		describe_en = "Lugia flies to the sky and flaps its wings to create a tornado to attack enemies in a row, dealing#C0x3D8A99#170% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Heals itself for 10% Max HP. It also absorbs a negative effect of an ally (priority given to ally with lowest HP%) and converts it into 15% of HP",
