		describe_en = "Torchic blows up its bell and spits fire to a single enemy, dealing (#C0xE69900#520% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$)#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Before attacking, it absorbes P.ATK and P.DEF (by 25% of own P.ATK and 30% P.DEF) for 2 rounds and adds 1 layer of [Burn] to the target; This attack inflicts extra 30% Crit and 80% Crit DMG",
