		simDesc_vn = "Torchic expande sua barriga e cospe chamas poderosamente para um único alvo inimigo que absorve o SP.ATK e P.ATK do alvo. O movimento aumenta o dano crítico e crítico de Torchic ao atacar alvos em chamas.",
		describe_kr = "토르칙이 종을 울리고 적 한 명에게 불을 뿜어 (#C0xE69900#520% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$)#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#를 처리합니다. 공격 전 2라운드 동안 P.ATK와 P.DEF(자신의 P.ATK의 25%, P.DEF의 30%)를 흡수하고 대상에게 [Burn] 1레이어를 추가합니다. 이 공격은 치명타 30%와 치명타 피해 80%를 추가로 입힙니다.",
		simDesc_th = "Torchic จะขยายท้องของมันและพ่นเปลวไฟอย่างทรงพลังไปยังเป้าหมายศัตรูตัวเดียว ซึ่งจะดูดซับ SP.ATK และ P.ATK ของเป้าหมาย การเคลื่อนไหวนี้จะเพิ่มคริติคอลและความเสียหายคริติคอลของ Torchic เมื่อโจมตีเป้าหมายที่ติดไฟ",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Efecto adicional: Inflige un efecto [Incineration] al objetivo después \n#F10#\n#F40#[Incineration]: Inflige un daño verdadero del 20% de HP máximo al objetivo, cada acumulación de efecto de quema aumentará la proporción de daño en 5 % y reducir el límite de HP del objetivo en la misma cantidad (daño total inferior al 500 % del propio P.ATK)",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "추가 효과 : 이후 대상에게 [Incineration] 효과를 줍니다 \n#F10#\n#F40#[Incineration] : 대상에게 최대 HP의 20% 고정 피해를 주며, 불타오르는 효과가 중첩될 때마다 피해 비율이 5씩 증가합니다. % (총 피해량은 자신의 P.ATK 500% 미만)",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Additional effect: Deals [Incineration] effect to the target afterward \n#F10#\n#F40#[Incineration] : Deals a true damage of 20% max HP to the target, each stack of burning effect will increase damage ratio by 5% and reduce target's HP limit by the same amount (total damage less than 500% own P.ATK)",
		simDesc_kr = "토치크는 배를 확장하고 단일 적 대상에게 강력하게 화염을 내뿜어 대상의 SP.ATK와 P.ATK를 흡수합니다. 이 움직임은 불타는 대상을 공격할 때 Torchic의 치명타 및 치명타 피해를 증가시킵니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#[Incineration] :ในขณะที่เอฟเฟกต์ทำงาน ให้ลดขีดจำกัด HP ของเป้าหมายลงด้วยจำนวนที่เท่ากัน (น้อยกว่า 500% P.ATK ของตัวเอง)#C0x5B545B#",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970#[Incineration] :효과가 발동되는 동안 대상의 HP 제한을 같은 양만큼 감소시킵니다(자신의 공격력의 500% 미만)#C0x5B545B#",
		starEffectDesc_en = "Additional effect: Deals [Incineration] effect to the target afterward \n#F10#\n#F40#[Incineration] : Deals a true damage of 20% max HP to the target, each stack of burning effect will increase damage ratio by 5% (total damage less than 500% own P.ATK)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "#C0x5c9970#[Incineration] :Enquanto o efeito é acionado, reduza o limite de HP do alvo na mesma quantidade (menos de 500% do próprio P.ATK)#C0x5B545B#",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "#C0x5c9970#[Incineration] :Saat efek dipicu, kurangi batas HP target dengan jumlah yang sama (kurang dari 500% P.ATK milik sendiri)#C0x5B545B#",
