		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Mega Gallade sweeps the enemy with the highest attack target with a double edge, dealing #C0xE69900#160% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, there is a 100% chance of confusing the target for 1 round before attacking, and adding [Lose Mind] for 3 rounds (Lose Mind: Negative effect, 40% reduction in control rate, 10% vulnerability, 80% when attacking teammates in confusion) There is a chance to confuse teammates and extend the chaos effect by 1 round the next time the target is confused by Mega Gallade)",
