		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Vigoroth strikes frantically on a single enemy target, dealing#C0xE69900#590% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, while disregarding the target's 30% P.DEF in this move. After attacking, it sleeps for 1 round (cannot be awakened or dispelled;Being attacked while sleeping will restore 100 additional Rage)",
