		simDesc_th = "Slaking โจมตีด้วยหมัดขั้นสุดยอดทำให้เป้าหมายศัตรูตัวเดียวบินได้ โดยไม่สนใจ P.DEF บางส่วน มันขี้เกียจเกินไปที่จะเคลื่อนไหวหลังจากทำการโจมตี",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Slaking lanza un Golpe Definitivo, derribando a un solo objetivo enemigo y causando#C0xE69900#600% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, sin tener en cuenta el 30% P.DEF del objetivo en este mover. Después de atacar, duerme durante 1 ronda (no se puede despertar ni disipar; ser atacado mientras duerme restaurará 100 de ira adicional)",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "효과 증폭 : 대상의 P.DEF를 40% 무시하고, 깨어난 후 3라운드 동안 궁극기 대미지의 30%를 증가시킵니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Slaking launches an Ultimate Blow, knocking up a single enemy target and dealing#C0xE69900#600% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, while disregarding the target's 30% P.DEF in this move. After attacking, it sleeps for 1 round (cannot be awakened or dispelled;Being attacked while sleeping will restore 100 additional Rage)",
		simDesc_kr = "Slaking은 P.DEF를 일부 무시하면서 단일 적 목표를 날아가게 만드는 궁극의 펀치를 날립니다. 공격을 한 후에는 움직이기가 너무 게으릅니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#การถูกโจมตีขณะหลับจะฟื้นฟูค่าความโกรธเพิ่มเติม 100 หน่วย",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970#자고 있는 동안 공격을 받으면 분노가 100 추가 회복됩니다.",
		starEffectDesc_en = "Effect boost: Disregards 40% of the target's P.DEF, and after being awake, it increases 30% of its Ultimate damage after for 3 rounds",
