		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Mega Aggron raises a big rock from the ground and smashes it with its iron head to attack a single enemy,dealing#C0xE69900#160% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, and makes the target flinch for next 3 rounds, and increase 50% Shiled Durability for 2 rounds. ([Flinch]:reducing its damage by 10%, but damage reduces by 30% when attacking steel-type Pokémons)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "aumente em 30% a durabilidade do Shiled nas próximas 2 rodadas.\n#F20#\n#F40##C0x5c9970#→aumente em 50% a durabilidade do Shiled nas próximas 3 rodadas.",
