		describe_kr = "A Pokémon that attacks Absol, and a random enemy will be inflicted with [Disaster] effect; A Pokémon attacked by Absol, and a random enemy will be inflicted with [Disaster] effect. When [Disaster] is effective, before each round, suffers one of the following effect: max HP reduced by #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#, SP.DEF and P.DEF reduced by #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#, SP.ATK and P.ATK reduced by #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#, and the next damage taken increased by #C0x5c9970#$(80+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B#. The effect does not stack. When Absol is in the battle, [Disaster] effect lasts.",
