		describe_en = "Regice rotates in the air and freezes the land when it lands, inflicting (#C0x3D8A99#150% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$)#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#to all enemies. Later, enters the [Ice Core] (Ice Core: Special effect, unable to move, immune to damage. The core breaks after taking 2 attacks. The target of breaking Ice Core will be [Frozen] for 2 rounds, if not broke, it is removed before the 2nd round starts after this Ultimate)",
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = "[Ice Core] dapat menahan 4 serangan, jika tidak dipatahkan, Regice memulihkan HP setara dengan 800% SP.DEF dan menghilangkan semua Debuff dan efek kontrol.",
		describe_id = "Regice berputar di udara dan membekukan tanah saat mendarat, menimbulkan (#C0x3D8A99#150% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$)#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#ke semua musuh. Nanti masuk ke [Ice Core] (Ice Core: Efek spesial, tidak bisa bergerak, kebal terhadap damage. Core pecah setelah menerima 2 serangan. Target menghancurkan Ice Core adalah [Frozen] selama 2 ronde, jika tidak pecah akan menjadi undefined dihilangkan sebelum ronde ke-2 dimulai setelah Ultimate ini)",
		simDesc_en = "Regice rotates in the air and freezes the land when it lands, attacking all enemies. Later, Regice enters the [Ice Core]",
		simDesc_vn = "Regice gira no ar e congela a terra ao pousar, atacando todos os inimigos. Mais tarde, Regice entra no [Ice Core]",
