		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "#C0x5c9970#The enemy controlled by the [Water Prison] will be trapped in [Vortex] for 1 round. [Vortex]: Special negative effect, can not be dispelled, the target in [Vortex] is reduced by 60% basic Speed and basic Rage recover speed. When the [Vortex] is triggered 3 times in the battle, the [Vortex] will be advanced to [Suffocation] (re-accumulate the number of Vortex after triggering Suffocation). [Suffocation]: Control effect, can not be dispelled/purified, immediately takes Water Elemental DMG equal to 20% of the current HP, cannot move, cannot get Rage; The DMG caused by the active skill of Water-Type ally will be transferred to the [Vortex/Suffocation] as Water Elemental DMG and heal the Water-Type Ally with lowest HP for 80% of this DMG",
