		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "#C0x5c9970#When in Lava State, increase 20% final DMG reduction; Aftere [Molten Core] is activated, inflict [Earth Seal] to the attacker for 2 rounds before being active attacked; To the target within the range, the true DMG of 20% of the lost HP is enhanced to the true DMG of 20% of the accumulated lost HP(will not exceeding 50% of its MAX HP); and the detonation DMG increase 20% (with [Molten Core] increase 10% more )",
