#F20#
#F40##L10#Molten Core:#L0# The DMG dealt by Desolate Land and Magma Armor will be absorbed and stored by Molten Core. When Primal Groudon takes lethal DMG, it retains 1 HP and activate#L10#Molten Core#L0#. When get attacked, priority Consumption the energy of #L10#Molten Core#L0#. Energy can not be recovered and will not take excessive DMG when it is exhausted,and the same amount of Rage will be recovered by consuming energy.#L10#Molten Core#L0# The maximum DMG absorption amount does not exceed 2 times of Primal Groudon's maximum HP,When Molten Core is activated, inflict [Earth Seal] to all enemies for 2 rounds. If triggerd [Molten Core] when the P.DEF&SP.DEF boosed by the [Magma Armor] is not lowered to the MIN, at leat 50% of its own HP will be retained in the [Molten Core] energy.
#F20#
#F40# When the [Molten Core] triggers or ends, summon a volcano to spew out lava, dealing Fire DMG equal to 200% of Primal Groudon P.ATK with lava burn, and has a 40% chance to [Stun] the enemy for 1 round.]],
