#F20#
#F40##L10#Magma Armor:#L0#After Primal Reversion, Primal Groudon's body is covered with lava:self-immune to Freeze; self-immune to displacement control like Whirlwind etc. Enemies attack Groudon will get 80% of its P.ATK Fire Elemental re-damage; [Magma Armor] increases 500% P.DEF&SP.DEF at the begining. And reduce 60% for each round, down to 200%(the first 3 rounds can not be ignored), and increase 20% final DMG reduction when facing non-attribute active skill attacks.
