		describe_en = "Prinplup rides on the tide to approach and attack enemies in a column, inflicting (#C0x3D8A99#280% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$) #C0xF13B54# SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. For every negative or control effect Piplup has, increases DMG by 20% (Up to 100%)",
