[#L10#Ghost Fire#L0#]: Spesial efek negatifnya, hanya bisa tersebar, tidak bisa ditumpuk. Ketika Ghost Fire dilancarkan/sebelum target bergerak atau Ghost Fire dihilangkan, mengurangi HP target (12% dari Max HP Giratina. Damagenya adalah True DMG) dan Rage sebanyak 120]],
		simDesc_en = "Giratina sneaks and attacks a single enemy as a ghost shadow, dealing P.DMG and increasing Rage Cap for the target. Gains some Ghost Shadows. [Origin Forme] extends the attack range into a column and gives this attack a chance to apply [Nether Fire]",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = [[
Giratina sneak attacks a single enemy as a ghost shadow, dealing #C0xE69900#170%P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, and increasing 20% DMG Reduction for allies in Giratina's row for 2 rounds. Gains 2 points of ghost shadow after this attack. 
#F20#
#F40#When in [#L10#Origin Forme#L0#], extends the attack range into a column and increases the [#L10#Nether Fire#L0#] chance by 80% for 2 rounds, and adds [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] for Ghost- and Dark-type allies
[#L10#Nether Fire#L0#]: Special negative effect, can only be dispelled, cannot stack. Effects added/Before the target moves or the Nether Fire gets dispelled, reduces the target's HP(12% of Giratina's Max HP. The damage is True DMG) and 120 Rage]],
		describe_kr = [[
기라티나는 유령 그림자로 적 하나를 기습 공격하여 (#C0xE69900#170% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$)#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#를 주고, 기라티나 전열에 있는 아군의 피해 감소를 15% 증가시킵니다. 2라운드. 이 공격 후 유령 그림자 2점을 얻습니다.
#F20#
