		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "When Giratina enters the battle, gains the number of ghost shadows as many Pokémon other than itself in ally team(Ghost Shadow Cap: 6 Points, cannot be dispelled or ignored). Each ghost shadow reduces own the final damage taken #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B#. Each 2 attacks taken reduces 1 ghost shadow. For ghost shadow lost, restores 80 Rage, after each big round ends gains 1 point of Ghost Shadow\n#F20#\n#F40#In each big round start, Giratina and ally with lowest HP in back row gains [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]; In the first round of the battle, inflict [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] to Dark- and Ghost-type allies ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: Shield amount equals to Giratina's 20% Max HP, ally gains addtional 5% bonus, unable to stack, target attacking Ghost Shield will become weaken: P.&SP.ATK reduce by 15% for 2 rounds); When switching to Origin Forme, Giratina recovers itself with 30% lost HP(Do not effected by heal-ban)",
