		describe_en = "When Giratina enters the battle, gains a ghost shadow for an ally on the field (Ghost Shadow Cap: 6 Points, cannot be dispelled or ignored). Each ghost shadow reduces the final damage taken by#C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B#. Each attack taken reduces 1 ghost shadow. For ghost shadow lost, restores 80 Rage, after each big round ends gains 1 Ghost Shadow\n#F20#\n#F40#In each big round start, Giratina and ally lowest HP in back row gains [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: Shield amount equals to Giratina's 20% Max HP, ally gains addtional 5% bonus, unable to stack, target attacking Ghost Shield will become weaken: P.&Sp.ATK reduce by 15% for 2 rounds). When switching to Origin Forme, Giratina recovers itself with 30% lost HP(Do not effected by heal-ban）",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = [[
