 Cuando cambia la fase lunar, se reducirá el CD de las propias habilidades pequeñas durante 1 ronda. 
#F10#
#F40##L10#Vuela con el sueño: #L0#Habilidad de aura: disipa el propio estado de sueño cuando se ve afectado por el efecto de sueño. Cuando cualquier objetivo en el campo recibe [Sweet Dream] o [Sleep], Cresselia y el aliado con el porcentaje de HP más bajo se curarán con un 10 % de HP de Cresselia. Y aumenta permanentemente la bonificación de DAÑO de todos los aliados en un 3% (hasta 12 capas). Al ser atacado, hay un 30% de posibilidades de hacer caer al objetivo [Sleep] durante 1 ronda. La probabilidad se duplica cuando es Luna Nueva.]],
		describe_en = [[
#L10#Moon Phase Change: #L0#It is Full Moon in the odd rounds. Gains #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# SP.DEF and P.DEF(cannot be dispelled); 
It is Mew Moon in the even rounds, gains #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.35-0.35)$%#C0x5B545B# healing rate (cannot be dispelled); 
 When the Moon Phase changes, it will reduce the CD of own small skills for 1 round. 
#F10#
#F40##L10#Fly with the dream: #L0#Aura skill: Dispels own Sleep status when affected by the Sleep effect. When any target on the field is inflicted with [Sweet Dream] or [Sleep], Cresselia and the ally with lowest HP percentage will be healed for 10% Cresselia HP. And permanently increase the DMG bounus of all allies by 3% (up to 12 layers) .]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "เมื่อถูกโจมตี มีโอกาส 30% ที่จะทำให้เป้าหมายตก [asleep] 1 รอบ โอกาสจะเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่าเมื่อถึงนิวมูน",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = [[
#L10#달의 위상 변화: #L0#홀수 라운드에서는 보름달입니다. #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# SP.DEF 및 P.DEF(해제 불가)를 얻습니다. 
짝수 라운드에서 뮤문이군요 #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.35-0.35)$%#C0x5B545B# 치유율(해제 불가); 
 문 페이즈가 바뀌면 1라운드 동안 자신의 소소한 스킬 CD가 줄어듭니다. 
#F10#
#F40##L10#꿈을 타고 날아라: #L0#오라 스킬: 수면 효과의 영향을 받을 때 자신의 수면 상태를 해제합니다. 필드에 있는 대상이 [Sweet Dream] 또는 [Sleep]에 걸리면 크레세리아와 HP 비율이 가장 낮은 아군의 크레세리아 HP가 10% 회복됩니다. 그리고 모든 아군의 데미지 보너스가 영구적으로 3% 증가합니다(최대 12개 레이어). 공격을 받을 때 30%의 확률로 대상을 1라운드 동안 [Sleep] 떨어뜨립니다. 월삭이 되면 확률은 두 배가 됩니다.]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "공격을 받을 때 30%의 확률로 대상을 1라운드 동안 [asleep] 떨어뜨립니다. 월삭이 되면 확률은 두 배가 됩니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = [[
#L10#Moon Phase Change: #L0#It is Full Moon in the odd rounds. Gains #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# SP.DEF and P.DEF(cannot be dispelled); 
It is Mew Moon in the even rounds, gains #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.35-0.35)$%#C0x5B545B# healing rate (cannot be dispelled); 
 When the Moon Phase changes, it will reduce the CD of own small skills for 1 round. 
#F10#
#F40##L10#Fly with the dream: #L0#Aura skill: Dispels own Sleep status when affected by the Sleep effect. When any target on the field is inflicted with [Sweet Dream] or [Sleep], Cresselia and the ally with lowest HP percentage will be healed for 10% Cresselia HP. And permanently increase the DMG bounus of all allies by 3% (up to 12 layers) . When being attacked, there is a 30% chance to make the target fall [Sleep] for 1 round. The chance doubles when it is at New Moon.]],
		describe_kr = [[
#L10#달의 위상 변화: #L0#홀수 라운드에서는 보름달입니다. #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# SP.DEF 및 P.DEF(해제 불가)를 얻습니다. 
짝수 라운드에서 뮤문이군요 #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.35-0.35)$%#C0x5B545B# 치유율(해제 불가); 
 문 페이즈가 바뀌면 1라운드 동안 자신의 소소한 스킬 CD가 줄어듭니다. 
#F10#
#F40##L10#꿈을 타고 날아라: #L0#오라 스킬: 수면 효과의 영향을 받을 때 자신의 수면 상태를 해제합니다. 필드에 있는 대상이 [Sweet Dream] 또는 [Sleep]에 걸리면 크레세리아와 HP 비율이 가장 낮은 아군의 크레세리아 HP가 10% 회복됩니다. 그리고 모든 아군의 데미지 보너스가 영구적으로 3% 증가합니다(최대 12개 레이어).]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "Ao ser atacado, há 30% de chance de fazer o alvo cair [asleep] por 1 rodada. A chance dobra quando é na Lua Nova.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "Saat diserang, ada peluang 30% membuat target jatuh [asleep] selama 1 putaran. Peluangnya berlipat ganda saat berada di Bulan Baru.",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "Efeito extra: Ao entrar no campo de batalha, arrasta o aliado com menor HP na linha de frente para [Sweet Dream].",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "Al ser atacado, hay un 30% de posibilidades de hacer caer al objetivo [asleep] durante 1 ronda. La probabilidad se duplica cuando es Luna Nueva.",
		describe_th = [[
#L10#ดวงจันทร์เปลี่ยน: #L0#เป็นพระจันทร์เต็มดวงในรอบคี่ ได้รับ #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# SP.DEF และ P.DEF(ไม่สามารถลบล้างได้); 
มันคือหมิวมูนในรอบคู่ ได้รับอัตราการฮีลเพิ่มขึ้น #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.35-0.35)$%#C0x5B545B# (ไม่สามารถปัดเป่าได้); 
 เมื่อ Moon Phase เปลี่ยนไป จะลด CD สกิลเล็กๆ ของตัวเองลง 1 รอบ 
#F10#
#F40##L10#บินไปกับความฝัน: #L0#ทักษะออร่า: ลบล้างสถานะการนอนหลับของตัวเองเมื่อได้รับผลกระทบจากเอฟเฟกต์การนอนหลับ เมื่อเป้าหมายใดๆ บนสนามได้รับความเสียหายด้วย [Sweet Dream] หรือ [Sleep] Cresselia และพันธมิตรที่มีเปอร์เซ็นต์ HP ต่ำที่สุดจะได้รับการรักษาเป็น 10% Cresselia HP และเพิ่มโบนัส DMG ของพันธมิตรทั้งหมดอย่างถาวร 3% (สูงสุด 12 ชั้น)]],
		starEffectDesc_en = "Extra effect: When enters in the battlefield, drags the ally with the lowest HP in the front-line into [Sweet Dream].",
