#F40#When it enters the [#L10#Land Forme#L0#], places [#L10#Bouquet Seed#L0#] for 2 rounds: All allies will restore HP before they move (100% of Shaymin's SP.ATK), receives an additional 20% DMG Reduction for 1 round when healed, increases 50% restore HP for Fairy Type/Grass Type/Ground Type allies. 
#F20#
#F40#When [#L10#Bouquet Seed#L0#] disappears, Shaymin restores 20% HP and has a 50% chance to [Constrict] all enemies for 1 round
#F10#
#F40# When Shaymin enters the battlefield for the first time, gets [Grateful Heart] mark.]],
		describe_kr = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#Shaymin 정말 감사합니다~#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#Shaymin 스위치는 3개의 빅 라운드마다 형성되며, 스위치 전환 시 분노가 300 증가합니다
#F20#
#F40#만들기[#L10#Barrier#L0#] 모든 아군이 받는 선형 및 잠입자 DMG 25% 감소 
#F20#
#F40# [#L10#Land Forme#L0#]에 진입하면 2라운드 동안 [#L10#Bouquet Seed#L0#] 배치: 모든 아군이 이동하기 전에 HP를 회복합니다(100% of Shaymin's SP.ATK)
#F20#
#F40#[#L10#Bouquet Seed#L0#]이 사라지면 셰이민의 HP가 20% 회복되고 50% 확률로 1라운드 동안 모든 적에게 [Constrict]가 발생합니다.]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "[Bouquet Seed] aumento de efeito: recebe uma redução adicional de 20% de DMG por 1 rodada quando curado, aumenta 50% de HP de restauração para aliados do tipo Fada / Tipo Grama / Tipo Terra. Quando Shaymin entra no campo de batalha pela primeira vez, recebe a marca [Grateful Heart].",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "[Bouquet Seed] peningkatan efek: menerima tambahan 20% Pengurangan DMG selama 1 ronde saat disembuhkan, meningkatkan 50% pemulihan HP untuk sekutu Tipe Peri/Tipe Rumput/Tipe Tanah. Saat Shaymin memasuki medan perang untuk pertama kalinya, mendapat nilai [Grateful Heart].",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "Efeito extra: Quando [Bouquet Seed] está lá, converte 15% do DMG que Shaymin recebe em Cura, cada ferimento não excederá 15% de HP.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "[Bouquet Seed] Aumento del efecto: recibe una reducción adicional de DAÑO del 20 % durante 1 ronda cuando se cura, aumenta un 50 % la restauración de HP para los aliados de tipo Hada/Tipo Hierba/Tipo Tierra. Cuando Shaymin entra al campo de batalla por primera vez, obtiene [Grateful Heart] marca.",
		describe_th = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#เชย์มิน ขอบคุณมาก~#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#เชย์มินเปลี่ยนรูปแบบทุกๆ 3 รอบใหญ่ ได้รับ 300 Rage เมื่อเปลี่ยน
#F20#
#F40#สร้าง [#L10#Barrier#L0#] เป็น ลดความเสียหายเชิงเส้นและตัวแทรกซึมที่พันธมิตรทั้งหมดได้รับ 25% 
#F20#
#F40#เมื่อมันเข้าสู่ [#L10#Land Forme#L0#] ตำแหน่ง [#L10#Bouquet Seed#L0#] เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ: พันธมิตรทั้งหมดจะฟื้นฟู HP ก่อนที่จะเคลื่อนที่ (100% ของ SP.ATK ของ Shaymin)
#F20#
#F40#เมื่อ [#L10#Bouquet Seed#L0#] หายไป Shaymin จะฟื้นฟู HP 20% และมีโอกาส 50% ที่จะทำให้ [Constrict] ศัตรูทั้งหมดเป็นเวลา 1 รอบ]],
		starEffectDesc_en = "Extra effect: When [Bouquet Seed] is there, converts 15% of DMG Shaymin takes to Healing, each injury will not exceed 15% HP.",
