#F40##L10#Tinder da Vitória: #L0#Quando Victini morre em batalha, ele se torna [Tinder of Victory], todos os aliados aumentam 50% de velocidade de recuperação de raiva e 20 % Crit Rage&Crit DMG por 2 rodadas; Pokémon do tipo Fogo recebem 300 de Raiva, se a raiva total dissipar imediatamente todo o controle não dominante e usar Ult Skill. O último Pokémon Fire-type sobrevivente se funde com o Tinder, restaura imediatamente 50% do HP MAX e aumenta 20% P.ATK e SP.ATK de Victini, e dissipa todos os efeitos de controle e Debuff. Se receber DMG letal, atrase a morte em 1 rodada e ganhe o dobro [Flame Armor]]],
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#V ah ah ah.. Do you want a macaron too? V#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10#Blazing Fire#L0#: When Victini on the battlefield, Fire Type allies immune to [Freeze] and [Constrict], and increase the Burning DMG by#C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.4-0.4)$%#C0x5B545B#, and last round +1 
 When allies inflict 3 layers of [Burn], add 12% Fire Type Vulnerablility. When allies inflict 4 layers of [Burn], enemy can not get Rage from Burn DMG
 When allies inflict 5 layers of [Burn], resolve a SP.DMG of Victini's 100% SP.ATK(for each additional Fire Type ally, the DMG will increase by 50% Victini's SP.ATK, cool down for 2 rounds)
#F10#
#F40# When Victini enter the battlefield, gets 2 rounds of [Flame Armor]. Increase 40% P.DEF&SP.DEF when Victini gains [Flame Armor] 
#F10#
#F40##L10#Dawn of Victory:#L0# When allies' HP is lower than 40% for first time or Every time ally defeat an enemy , all allies will be inspired: increase 20% initial Speed and P.ATK&SP.ATK for 2 rounds. Fire Type Pokemon gains 200 Rage(it also take effect during the [Tinder of Victory] ); and Victini immediately use #L10#MetFire
#F10#
#F40##L10#Tinder of Victory:#L0# When Victini dies in battle, it becomes [Tinder of Victory].It will immediately deal 400% SP.ATK DMG to the enemy with highest Rage, and burn out its Rage ;all allies increase 50% Rage recover speed, 20% Crit Rage&Crit DMG for 2 rounds; Fire Type Pokemon get 300 Rage, if full rage immediately dispel all non-dominant control and use Ult Skill. The last surviving Fire Type Pokemon merges with the Tinder, immediately restores 50% MAX HP and increase 20% P.ATK&SP.ATK from Victini, and dispel all control effect and Debuff. If takes lethal DMG, delay death by 1 round and gain double [Flame Armor]]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "Quando o HP dos aliados estiver abaixo de 40% pela primeira vez, todos os aliados ficarão inspirados: aumente em 20% a Velocidade inicial e P.ATK&SP.ATK por 2 rodadas (até 2 camadas); Quando [Tinder of Victory] for acionado, cause imediatamente 400% de SP.ATK DMG ao inimigo com maior Fúria e queime sua Fúria. O Pokémon se funde com o Tinder aumenta adicional 20% de DMG e redução de DMG por 2 rodadas",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "Ketika HP sekutu lebih rendah dari 40% untuk pertama kalinya, semua sekutu akan terinspirasi: meningkatkan 20% Kecepatan awal dan P.ATK&SP.ATK selama 2 putaran (hingga 2 lapisan); Ketika [Tinder of Victory] terpicu, segera menimbulkan 400% SP.ATK DMG ke musuh dengan Rage tertinggi, dan membakar Rage-nya. Pokemon yang digabungkan dengan Tinder meningkatkan tambahan 20% DMG & pengurangan DMG selama 2 ronde",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "Cuando el HP de los aliados sea inferior al 40 % por primera vez, todos los aliados se inspirarán: aumentará un 20 % la velocidad inicial y P.ATK&SP.ATK durante 2 rondas (hasta 2 capas); Cuando se activa [Tinder of Victory], inflige inmediatamente 400% SP.ATK DAÑO al enemigo con mayor ira y quema su ira. El Pokémon se fusiona con Tinder, aumento adicional del 20% de DAÑO y reducción de DAÑO durante 2 rondas.",
		describe_id = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#V ah ah ah... Mau macaron juga? V#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10#Blazing Fire#L0#: Saat Victini berada di medan perang, sekutu tipe Api kebal terhadap [Freeze] dan [Constrict], dan meningkatkan Burning DMG sebanyak #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.4-0.4)$%#C0x5B545B#, dan putaran terakhir +1
Saat sekutu menimbulkan setidaknya 3 lapis [Burn], tambahkan 12% Kerentanan Tipe Api ke musuh. Saat sekutu menimbulkan minimal 4 lapis [Burn], musuh tidak bisa mendapatkan Rage dari Burn DMG
Saat sekutu menimbulkan minimal 5 lapis [Burn], selesaikan SP.DMG dari 100% SP.ATK Victini (untuk setiap Tembakan tambahan -tipe sekutu, SP.DMG akan meningkat sebesar 50% dari SP.ATK Victini, cooldown selama 2 ronde)
#F10#
#F40#Saat Victini memasuki medan perang, mendapat 2 ronde [Flame Armor]. Tingkatkan 40% P.DEF&SP.DEF saat Victini memperoleh [Flame Armor]
#F10#
#F40##L10#Fajar Kemenangan: #L0#Setiap kali sekutu mengalahkan musuh, semua sekutu akan terinspirasi: meningkat 20% Kecepatan awal dan P.ATK&SP.ATK sebanyak 2 putaran. Pokemon tipe api memperoleh 200 Rage (ini juga berlaku selama [Tinder of Victory]); dan Victini segera menggunakan #L10#MetFire
#F10#
#F40##L10#Tinder of Victory: #L0#Saat Victini mati dalam pertempuran, menjadi [Tinder of Victory], semua sekutu meningkatkan 50% Rage Recovery Speed ​​dan 20 % Crit Rage & Crit DMG selama 2 ronde; Pokemon tipe api mendapat 300 Rage, jika rage penuh segera hilangkan semua kontrol yang tidak dominan dan gunakan Skill Ult. Pokemon tipe Api terakhir yang bertahan bergabung dengan Tinder, segera memulihkan 50% MAX HP dan meningkatkan 20% P.ATK&SP.ATK dari Victini, serta menghilangkan semua efek kontrol dan Debuff. Jika menerima DMG mematikan, tunda kematian sebanyak 1 ronde dan dapatkan keuntungan dua kali lipat [Flame Armor]]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "처음으로 아군의 HP가 40% 미만일 때 모든 아군은 영감을 받습니다. 2라운드 동안 초기 속도와 P.ATK&SP.ATK가 20% 증가합니다(최대 2레이어). [Tinder of Victory]가 발동되면 즉시 분노가 가장 높은 적에게 400% SP.ATK 데미지를 주고 분노를 태워버립니다. 포켓몬이 틴더와 합쳐지면 2라운드 동안 20% 데미지 및 데미지 감소가 추가로 증가합니다.",
