#F10#
#F40##L10#Tinder of Victory:#L0# Cuando Victini muere en batalla, se convierte en [Tinder of Victory]. Inmediatamente infligirá 400% SP.ATK DMG al enemigo con mayor ira y quema su ira; todos los aliados aumentan un 50% la velocidad de recuperación de ira, un 20% de ira crítica y daño crítico durante 2 rondas; Los Pokémon de tipo Fuego obtienen 300 de ira; si está en plena ira, disipa inmediatamente todo el control no dominante y usa la habilidad definitiva. El último Pokémon de tipo Fuego superviviente se fusiona con Tinder, restaura inmediatamente el 50% de MAX HP y aumenta el 20% P.ATK&SP.ATK de Victini, y disipa todos los efectos de control y desventajas. Si recibe daño letal, retrasa la muerte 1 ronda y gana el doble [Flame Armor]]],
		describe_en = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#Flaming Flying Sword!#C0x5B545B##L10#Blazing Fire#L0#: When Victini on the battlefield, Fire-type allies immune to [Freeze] and [Constrict], and increase the Burning DMG by #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.4-0.4)$%#C0x5B545B#, and last round +1
When allies inflict at least 3 layers of [Burn], add 12% Fire-type Vulnerablility to emenies. When allies inflict at least 4 layers of [Burn], enemies cannot get Rage from Burn DMG
When allies inflict at least 5 layers of [Burn], resolve a SP.DMG of Victini's 100% SP.ATK(for each additional Fire-type ally, the SP.DMG will increase by 50% of Victini's SP.ATK, cool down for 2 rounds)
#F10#
#F40#When Victini enter the battlefield, gets a 2-round [Flame Armor]. Increase 40% P.DEF&SP.DEF when Victini gains [Flame Armor]
#F10#
#F40##L10#Dawn of Victory: #L0#Every time ally defeat an enemy, all allies will be inspired: increase 20% initial Speed and P.ATK&SP.ATK for 2 rounds. Fire-type Pokemon gains 200 Rage(it also take effect during the [Tinder of Victory]); and Victini immediately use #L10#MetFire
#F10#
#F40##L10#Tinder of Victory: #L0#When Victini dies in battle, it becomes [Tinder of Victory], all allies increase 50% Rage Recovery Speed and 20% Crit Rage&Crit DMG for 2 rounds; Fire-type Pokemon get 300 Rage, if full rage immediately dispell all non-dominant control and use Ult Skill. The last surviving Fire-type Pokemon merges with the Tinder, immediately restores 50% MAX HP and increase 20% P.ATK&SP.ATK from Victini, and dispell all control effect and Debuff. If takes lethal DMG, delay death by 1 round and gain double [Flame Armor]]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "เมื่อ HP ของพันธมิตรต่ำกว่า 40% ในครั้งแรก พันธมิตรทั้งหมดจะได้รับแรงบันดาลใจ: เพิ่มความเร็วเริ่มต้น 20% และ P.ATK&SP.ATK เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ (สูงสุด 2 ชั้น); เมื่อ [Tinder of Victory] เริ่มทำงาน สร้างความเสียหาย SP.ATK 400% ทันทีแก่ศัตรูที่มีระดับความโกรธสูงสุด และเผาผลาญความโกรธของมัน โปเกมอนรวมตัวกับ Tinder เพิ่ม DMG และลด DMG 20% เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#불타는 비검#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10#타오르는 불#L0#: 비크티니가 전장에 있을 때 화염 계열 아군은 [Freeze] 및 [Constrict]에 면역이 되며, Burning DMG by#C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.4-0.4)$%#C0x5B545B#, 마지막 라운드 +1 
 아군이 [Burn]의 3겹을 적용하면 화재 유형 취약성이 12% 추가됩니다. 아군이 [Burn] 4겹 적용 시 적은 화상 피해로 인한 분노를 얻을 수 없습니다
 아군이 [Burn] 5겹 적용 시 비크티니의 100% SP.ATK SP.DMG 해결(추가 화염 유형 아군마다, DMG는 비크티니의 SP.ATK 50% 증가, 2라운드 쿨다운)
