		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Krokorok se sumerge en el suelo y reaparece ante el único objetivo enemigo para atacarlo golpeando su cola, causando#C0xE69900#510% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Este movimiento también causa el 20% del daño a los objetivos cercanos y los ciega durante 2 rondas: el objetivo principal y los objetivos cercanos tienen un 65% y un 35% de posibilidades de fallar su próximo ataque respectivamente.",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "실명 효과 업그레이드: 주 대상은 공격을 놓칠 확률이 80%이고, 근처 대상은 공격을 놓칠 확률이 40%입니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Krokorok dives into the soil and reappears before the single enemy target to attack it by slapping its tail, dealing#C0xE69900#510% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. This move also deals 20% of the damage to nearby targets, and blinds them for 2 rounds: the main target and nearby targets gets a 65% and 35% chance of missing its next attack respectively.",
