		describe_vn = "Zorua se transforma em um objeto preto e misterioso e ataca um único alvo inimigo continuamente, distribuindo#C0x3D8A99#460% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Se o alvo ainda estiver vivo, ele se transformará em uma ilusão do alvo por 1 rodada, e enquanto estiver nesta ilusão, os inimigos não poderão selecioná-lo enquanto ataca o alvo (exceto o alvo da ilusão), e compartilha todos os efeitos de buff do inimigo",
		starEffectDesc_th = "ผลกระทบเพิ่มเติม: 20% ของความเสียหายที่ได้รับจะถูกภาพลวงตาในท่า Ultimate",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "Efeito adicional: 20% do dano recebido será recebido pela sua ilusão no movimento Ultimate",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "조루아는 검고 신비한 물체로 변신해 단일 적 대상을 연속적으로 공격해 #C0x3D8A99#460% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#를 줍니다. 대상이 살아 있는 경우 2라운드 동안 대상의 환영으로 변하고, 이 환상에 있는 동안 적들은 이를 공격 대상으로 선택할 수 없으며(환상의 대상 제외) 모든 버프 효과를 공유합니다. 적의",
		describe_en = "Zorua transforms into a black and mysterious object and attacks a single enemy target continuously, dealing#C0x3D8A99#460% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. If the target is still alive, it will turn itself into an illusion of the target for 1 round, and while it is in this illusion, enemies cannot select it as it attacking target (except the target of illusion), and shares all buff effect of the enemy",
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = "Zorua berubah menjadi objek hitam dan misterius dan menyerang satu target musuh secara terus-menerus, menimbulkan#C0x3D8A99#460% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Jika target masih hidup, ia akan berubah menjadi ilusi target selama 2 putaran, dan selama berada dalam ilusi ini, musuh tidak dapat memilihnya sebagai target yang menyerang (kecuali target ilusi), dan berbagi semua efek buff. musuh",
