		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Zorua transforms into a black and mysterious object and attacks a single enemy target continuously, dealing#C0x3D8A99#460% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. If the target is still alive, it will turn itself into an illusion of the target for 2 rounds, and while it is in this illusion, enemies cannot select it as it attacking target (except the target of illusion), and shares all buff effect of the enemy",
