		describe_en = "Gothita flies high up into the sky before creating a Psyshock around the single enemy target, dealing#C0x3D8A99#420% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Gothorita then enters into another dimension after crushing it with a beam where the next Pokémon that attacks it will enter the twisted dimension and will only appear on its next turn.",
