		describe_en = "Litwick sends Will-O-Wisp to a single enemy target, dealing#C0x3D8A99#160% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, and inflicts the target with [Will-O-Wisp] effect.\n[Will-O-Wisp]: Reduces 100 rage points instantly and reduces the same amount of rage before the next move",
