		describe_en = "Litwick summons a large number of Will-O-Wisps surrounding itself before hurling it towards enemy targets in a row, dealing#C0x3D8A99#220% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. The damage of this move will not create more rage for the target and inflicts [Will-O-Wisp] effect.\n[Will-O-Wisp]: Reduces 150 rage points instantly and reduces the same amount of rage before the next move",
