		describe_id = "Litwick memanggil sejumlah besar Will-O-Wisps yang mengelilinginya sebelum melemparkannya ke arah target musuh berturut-turut, menimbulkan#C0x3D8A99#220% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Kerusakan dari gerakan ini tidak akan menimbulkan lebih banyak kemarahan pada target dan menimbulkan efek [Will-O-Wisp].\n[Will-O-Wisp]: Mengurangi 150 poin kemarahan secara instan dan mengurangi jumlah kemarahan yang sama sebelum gerakan berikutnya",
		simDesc_en = "Litwick summons a large number of Will-O-Wisps surrounding itself before hurling them at the enemies. DMG of this move will not generate rage for the enemies and inflicts 【Will-O-Wisp】 effect",
		simDesc_vn = "Litwick invoca um grande número de Will-O-Wisps cercando-se antes de arremessá-los contra os inimigos. O DMG deste movimento não gerará raiva para os inimigos e infligirá o efeito 【Will-O-Wisp】",
		describe_kr = "리트윅은 자신을 둘러싸고 있는 수많은 Will-O-Wisps를 소환한 후 연속으로 적 대상을 향해 던지며 #C0x3D8A99#220% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#를 처리합니다. 이 동작의 피해는 대상에게 더 많은 분노를 생성하지 않으며 [Will-O-Wisp] 효과를 적용합니다.\n[Will-O-Wisp]: 분노 포인트가 즉시 150 감소하고 다음 동작 전에 동일한 양의 분노가 감소합니다.",
		simDesc_th = "Litwick เรียก Will-O-Wisps จำนวนมากมาล้อมรอบตัวเองก่อนที่จะขว้างพวกมันใส่ศัตรู ความเสียหายของการเคลื่อนไหวนี้จะไม่สร้างความโกรธแค้นให้กับศัตรูและสร้างเอฟเฟกต์ 【Will-O-Wisp】",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Litwick invoca una gran cantidad de Will-O-Wisps que se rodean antes de lanzarlos hacia objetivos enemigos en fila, causando#C0x3D8A99#220% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. El daño de este movimiento no creará más ira en el objetivo e inflige el efecto [Will-O-Wisp].\n[Will-O-Wisp]: Reduce 150 puntos de ira instantáneamente y reduce la misma cantidad de ira antes del siguiente movimiento; Reduce la velocidad de recuperación de ira de los enemigos en un 30 % durante 2 rondas.",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "Will-O-Wisp로 적을 공격한 유닛은 다음 궁극기에서 치명타가 20% 증가합니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Litwick summons a large number of Will-O-Wisps surrounding itself before hurling it towards enemy targets in a row, dealing#C0x3D8A99#220% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. The damage of this move will not create more rage for the target and inflicts [Will-O-Wisp] effect.\n[Will-O-Wisp]: Reduces 150 rage points instantly and reduces the same amount of rage before the next move; Reduce enemies Rage recover Speed by 30% for 2 rounds",
		simDesc_kr = "Litwick은 자신을 둘러싸고 있는 수많은 Will-O-Wisps를 소환한 후 적에게 던집니다. 이 기술의 데미지는 적에게 분노를 생성하지 않고 【Will-O-Wisp】 효과를 줍니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "ผลกระทบเพิ่มเติม: ลดความเร็วในการฟื้นฟู Rage ของศัตรู 30% เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "추가 효과: 2라운드 동안 적의 분노 회복 속도를 30% 감소시킵니다.",
