		describe_id = "Fraxure menggunakan cakarnya yang besar untuk menyerang satu target musuh, menyebabkan#C0xE69900#150% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Ini juga akan [Lock] target (Kunci: Selama target bertahan, target akan selalu menyerang target dan juga akan terkena taunt), dan meningkatkan tingkat serangan pengejaran berikutnya sebesar 20%",
		simDesc_en = "Fraxure uses its huge claws to slash a single enemy target",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Fraxure uses its huge claws to attack a single enemy target, dealing#C0xE69900#150% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. It will also [Lock] the target (Lock:Reduced DMG Reduction by 20%; As long as the target survives, it will always attack the target and will also affected by taunt), and increases the next pursuit attack rate by 20%",
		describe_kr = "프랙셔는 거대한 발톱을 사용해 단일 적 대상을 공격하며#C0xE69900#150% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#를 처리합니다. 또한 대상을 [Lock](잠금: 대상이 살아남는 한 항상 대상을 공격하며 도발의 영향을 받습니다)하고, 다음 추격 공격 속도를 20% 증가시킵니다.",
