		starEffectDesc_th = "เอฟเฟกต์เสริม: หากเป้าหมายถูกน็อค มันจะได้รับ P.ATK เพิ่มขึ้น 40% อย่างถาวร (สูงสุด 4 ชั้น ไม่สามารถลบล้างได้) และทักษะ Ult จะกระตุ้นการโจมตีไล่ตามอย่างหลีกเลี่ยงไม่ได้",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "Aumento de efeito: Se o alvo for nocauteado, ele ganha um aumento permanente de 40% no P.ATK (até 4 camadas, incapaz de dissipar), e a Ult Skill inevitavelmente acionará o ataque de perseguição",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "효과 부스트 : 대상이 넉아웃된 경우 영구적으로 공격력이 40% 증가(최대 4레이어, 해제 불가)되며, 궁극기 스킬은 추격 공격을 발동시켜야 합니다.",
		describe_en = "Fraxure charges up energy and rushes towards a single enemy target before attacking it with shock wave, dealing#C0xE69900#450% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, and reduces its P.DEF by 10% permanently. If the target is killed, Fraxure's P.ATK will increase permanently by 20%",
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = "Peningkatan efek: Jika target tersingkir, ia memperoleh peningkatan P.ATK permanen sebesar 40% (hingga 4 lapisan, tidak dapat dihilangkan), dan Skill Ult harus memicu serangan pengejaran",
