		starEffectDesc_th = "เอฟเฟกต์เพิ่มเติม: ศัตรูใน [Hurricane] รับความเสียหายต่อเนื่องเพิ่มขึ้น 50% เมื่อได้รับความเสียหายและก่อนแต่ละรอบ ลดความเร็ว&SP.DEF 10% สามารถซ้อนกันได้",
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = "Memanggil tiga [Hurricane] ke arah dirinya sendiri ([Hurricane]: efek khusus, ketika diberikan kepada sekutu, masing-masing [Hurricane] meningkatkan 20% tingkat Evasion. Sebelum setiap putaran, berikan satu [Hurricane] ke musuh di garis depan, dan ledakkan hingga 2 Debuff dari 3 sekutu ke musuh. Sebelum setiap ronde, musuh dengan [Hurricane] akan terkena Tornadus'#C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B#SP.ATK Fly Type DMG dan [Burn] disalin ke target sekitar untuk 3 ronde. [Hurricane] berlangsung selama 3 ronde. Saat Tornadus berada di medan perang, sekutu Tipe Terbang kebal terhadap efek [Hurricane], dan ada peluang 40% untuk mendapatkan 1 [Hurricane] setelah bergerak)",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Invoca tres [Hurricane] alrededor de sí mismo ([Hurricane]: efecto especial, cuando se inflige a aliados, cada [Hurricane] aumenta un 20 % la tasa de evasión. Antes de cada ronda, inflige un [Hurricane] a un enemigo de primera línea y explota a 2 Desventaja de 3 aliados al enemigo. Antes de cada ronda, el enemigo con [Hurricane] obtendrá Tornadus'#C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B#SP.ATK Fly Type DMG y el [Burn] se copia al objetivo circundante para 3 rondas. [Hurricane] dura 3 rondas. Cuando Tornadus está en el campo de batalla, los aliados tipo Mosca son inmunes al efecto [Hurricane], y hay un 40% de posibilidades de obtener 1 [Hurricane] después del movimiento).",
		describe_en = "Summons 3 [Hurricane] around at itself(Hurricane: special effect, when inflicted to allies, each Hurricane increases 20% Evasion Rate. Before each round, inflicts 1 [Hurricane] to a random front-line enemy, and blows up to 2 Debuff of 3 allies to enemy. Before each round the enemy with [Hurricane] will get Flying-type DMG of Tornadus' #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# SP.ATK and the [Burn] is copied to the surrounding target for 3 rounds. [Hurricane] lasts for 3 rounds. When Tornadus is in battlefields, Flying-type allies is immune to [Hurricane] effect)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "พันธมิตรประเภทแมลงวันมีโอกาส 40% ที่จะได้รับ 1 [Hurricane]",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "주위에 [Hurricane] 3개 소환 ([Hurricane]: 특수 효과, 아군에게 가할 때 각각 [Hurricane] 회피율이 20% 증가합니다. 매 라운드 전에 최전선의 적에게 [Hurricane] 1개를 부여하고 폭파시킵니다. 적에게 아군 3명의 디버프 2개. 매 라운드 전에 [Hurricane]를 가진 적은 Tornadus'#C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B#SP.ATK 플라이 유형 DMG를 얻고 [Burn]는 주변 대상에 복사됩니다. 3라운드 [Hurricane] 3라운드 동안 지속됩니다. 토나두스가 전장에 있을 때 플라이 타입 아군은 [Hurricane] 효과에 면역이며, 이동 후 40% 확률로 1[Hurricane]를 얻습니다.)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "플라이 타입 아군은 40% 확률로 1 [Hurricane]을 얻습니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Summons three [Hurricane] around at itself ([Hurricane]: special effect, when inflicted to allies, each [Hurricane] increase 20% Evasion rate. Before each round, inflict one [Hurricane] to a front-line enemy, and blow up to 2 Debuff of 3 allies to enemy. Before each round the enemy with [Hurricane] will get Tornadus'#C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B#SP.ATK Fly Type DMG and the [Burn] is copied to the surrounding target for 3 rounds. [Hurricane] lasts for 3 rounds. When Tornadus is in battlefields, Fly Type allies is immune to [Hurricane] effect, and there is a 40% chance to get 1 [Hurricane]  after move)",
		describe_kr = "주위에 3개의 [Hurricane] 소환(허리케인: 특수 효과, 아군에게 적용 시 각 허리케인의 회피율이 20% 증가합니다. 매 라운드 전 무작위 전방 적에게 1[Hurricane]을 부여하고 최대 2개의 디버프를 불어넣습니다. 각 라운드 전에 [Hurricane]를 가진 적은 토네이도스의 비행형 데미지 #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# SP.ATK를 얻고 [Burn]는 주변 대상에게 3만큼 복사됩니다. [Hurricane] 3라운드 동안 지속됩니다. 토네이도스가 전장에 있을 때 비행형 아군은 [Hurricane] 효과에 면역입니다.)",
