#C0xC0C0C0#Lightning! Expel your delusions#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#Zekrom stands on the top of the city to launch a sky-cracking lightning storm. Inflicts (#C0xE69900#360% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$) #C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B# to the enemy. Before releasing Ultimate, instantly gains 3 [Charges] and rounds the overflowing charge into 150 Rage.
#F20#
