		describe_en = "Kyurem turns the world into a hunting ground when it wakes up beneath the glaciers, gaining 2 [Snowflakes]. If there are no [Hunted] targets on the field, applies[Hunt] to a random rear-line enemy and turn the field into [Glaciate]for 2 rounds, dealing (#C0xE69900#400% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$)#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#to the target. \n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Glaciate:#L0#Reduces Speed, SP.DEF and P.DEF of all enemies by 30%, taunts [Hunted] foes in Glaciate. (Taunt: Control effect, forces the targets to attack the caster). Grabs 25% SP.ATK and P.ATK, 150 Rage and 1 buff from the target and freezes one random enemy. When a [Hunted] enemy faints, instantly grants 1 [Hunt] to a rear-line enemy.",
