		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Kailudio llegó sobre las olas, los cuernos en su frente formaron una espada que podía desgarrar todo y cortar a un solo objetivo enemigo, causando#C0x3D8A99#500% Sp.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#Sp.DMG#C0x5B545B#, si tienes más de 3 capas de Espada Leal, ingresa [Resolute Form] que continúan hasta el final de la batalla\n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Forma resuelta:#L0#efecto especial, aumenta las 6 estadísticas originales en un 25% . Antes de cada ataque de Keldeo, disipará 1 efecto de mejora del objetivo.",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "추가 효과: [Loyal Sword] 스택마다 대상의 Sp.DEF를 10% 무시합니다. Keldeo가 [Loyal Sword]의 5개 스택을 가지고 있는 경우, 공격이 시작되기 전에 일시적으로 치명타율이 50% 증가합니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Kailudio came on the waves, horns on his forehead formed a sword that could tear everything and cut an enemy single target, dealing#C0x3D8A99#500% Sp.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#Sp.DMG#C0x5B545B#, if having over 3 layers of Loyal Sword, enter [Resolute Form] which continue until the end of the battle\n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Resolute Form:#L0#special effect, increase original 6 stats by 25%. Before every time Keldeo attacks, it will dispel 1 buff effect from the target.",
