		describe_en = "Phantump grows huge roots and curses enemies in the back line from two sides to deal#C0xE69900#170%P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*26)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#with 20% chance to [Silence] targets for 1 round (Silence: The target is unable to use small skills and Ultimate skills)",
