		describe_en = "Noibat flies high to the sky and releases a series of sound waves to attack enemies in a row, dealing#C0x3D8A99#210% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. If its speed is higher than the target, this move will ignore 35% of target's SP.DEF, with a 60% chance of confusing the target for 1 round",
