		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Noibat flies high to the sky and releases a series of sound waves to attack enemies in a row, dealing#C0x3D8A99#210% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. If its speed is higher than the target, this move will ignore 35% of target's SP.DEF, with a 60% chance of confusing the target for 1 round.The first two Ult Skill, if Speed is faster than target, there is a 100% chance to confusing the target for 1 round.",
		simDesc_kr = "노이바트가 하늘 높이 날아올라 소닉 스톰을 발사해 일렬로 늘어선 적을 공격합니다. 대상보다 속도가 빠르면 특정 SP.DEF를 무시하고 일정 확률로 대상을 【혼란】시킵니다.",
