		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "#C0x5c9970#Complete Form: The number of attacked targets +1, when activating [Core Enforce], increase addtional DMG of 10% of the target's Max HP(no more than 500% its P.ATK) and reduce target's Hit rate 10% for 1 round\n 50% Form:The number of attacked targets +1, and when [Core Enforce] is activated, an addtional layer of [Poison Arrow] will be inflicted to target and immediately trigger DMG effect of Poison Arrow\n 10% Forme: The attribute improvement effect of basic attack is doubled and can be stacked 5 times; the additional DMG and passive DMG caused by the target of [Core Enforce] to self is reduced by 50%#C0x5B545B#",
		describe_vn = [[
