		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "#C0x5c9970# After 【Cherish the young】 takes a fatal blow on behalf of a cub, Drampa will not be defeated, retaining 20% of its maximum HP (once per battle). The cub permanently carries【Dragon's Breath】 when initiating attacks.",
		starEffectDesc_es = "Durante los primeros 5 turnos, al comienzo de cada turno, para el cachorro protegido por 【Cherish the young】 Drampa aumenta permanentemente sus seis atributos de entrada en un 5%.",
