		simDesc_th = "ฉันสามารถแอบเข้าไปในเงาของคุณ ~",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Ingresa [Full Mode] durante 2 rondas antes de soltar [Soul-Stealing 7-Star]\n#F40##L10#Modo completo: #L0# Antes de usar la habilidad Ult, absorbe un 30% P.ATK adicional de otros aliados de tipo Fantasma/Lucha. Cada DAÑO aumenta a 140% y roba el 2% de HP máximo del objetivo (el acumulado no excede el 50% de su propio HP máximo) y se agrega un Puño pesado al final, lo que causa un DAÑO verdadero de 300% P.ATK. Si el objetivo no muere, se descartará la mitad de P.DEF y SP.DEF, lo que provocará el doble de [Stun] al objetivo durante 1 ronda.",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "출시 전 [Full Mode]를 2라운드 입력하세요 [Soul-Stealing 7-Star]\n#F40##L10#풀 모드: #L0# 궁극기 사용 전, 다른 고스트/격투 타입 포켓몬의 P.ATK 30%를 추가로 흡수합니다. 각 데미지는 140%로 증가하고, 마지막에 추가 헤비 펀치가 추가되어 실제 데미지는 P.ATK 200%가 됩니다. 대상이 죽지 않으면 P.DEF&SP.DEF의 절반이 버려져 1라운드 동안 대상에 두 배의 [Stun]가 발생합니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Enter [Full Mode] for 2 rounds before releasing [Soul-Stealing 7-Star]\n#F40##L10#Full Mode: #L0# Before using Ult skill, absorbs additional 30% P.ATK of other Ghost/Fight Type allies. Each DMG increase to 140% and steal target's 2% Max HP(Accumulated does not exceed 50% of own Max HP) and a Heavy Fist is added at the end, causing true DMG of 300% P.ATK. If the target is not killed, half of P.DEF&SP.DEF will be discarded, causing double [Stun] to the target for 1 round.",
		simDesc_kr = "너의 그림자 속으로 몰래 들어갈 수 있어~",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "ความเสียหายที่แท้จริงของ Heavy Fist เพิ่มขึ้นเป็น 300% P.ATK [Soul-Stealing 7-Star] การโจมตีแต่ละครั้งจะขโมย HP สูงสุดของเป้าหมาย 2% (สะสมได้ไม่เกิน 50% ของ HP สูงสุดของตัวเอง)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "헤비 피스트의 실제 데미지가 P.ATK 300%로 증가합니다. [Soul-Stealing 7-Star] 각 공격은 대상의 최대 HP를 2% 훔칩니다(누적은 자신의 최대 HP의 50%를 초과하지 않습니다)",
		starEffectDesc_en = "Enter [Full Mode] for 2 rounds before releasing [Soul-Stealing 7-Star]\n#F40##L10#Full Mode: #L0# Before using Ult skill, absorbs additional 30% P.ATK of other Ghost/Fight Type Pokemon. Each DMG increase to 140%, and an extra Heavy Punch is added at the end, causing true DMG of 200% P.ATK. If the target is not killed, half of P.DEF&SP.DEF will be discarded, causing double [Stun] to the target for 1 round.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "O verdadeiro DMG do Heavy Fist aumenta para 300% P.ATK. [Soul-Stealing 7-Star] cada ataque rouba 2% do HP máximo do alvo (o acumulado não excede 50% do próprio HP máximo)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "DMG sebenarnya dari Tinju Berat meningkat menjadi 300% P.ATK. [Soul-Stealing 7-Star] setiap serangan mencuri 2% Max HP target (Akumulasi tidak melebihi 50% dari Max HP sendiri)",
		id = 41213,
