		describe_en = "Poipole drenches the target in a column with a special poisonous liquid from above. Inflicts (#C0x3D8A99#290% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$)#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, applies 1 layer of [Poison] for 3 rounds, and instantly concludes Poison DMG for 1 time.",
