		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Poipole drenches the target in a column with a special poisonous liquid from above, dealing (#C0x3D8A99#290% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$) #C0xF13B54# SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Applies 1 layer of [Poison] for 3 rounds, instantly concludes Poison DMG for 1 time, and deals 30% increased DMG to targets below 30% HP",
