		simDesc_th = "เซราโอรารวบรวมกระแสไฟฟ้าหลายพันโวลต์ไว้ในมือทั้งสองข้าง และโจมตีศัตรูทันที 5 ครั้งด้วยความเร็วดุจเสิร์ฟลม หากโดนศัตรูที่แตกต่างกัน จะสร้างเอฟเฟกต์ [Static Field]",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Si hay [Lightning Phantom] después del lanzamiento, combínalo con Lightning Phantom para convertirte en [Lightning Dharma] durante 2 rondas\nLightning Dharma: agrega Lightning Phantom el 60 % del atributo actual y aumenta la esquiva en un 50 % adicional, cada ataque activo es para lanzar Plasma Fists (no consume, restaura la ira pero reduce su propia velocidad de recuperación de ira en un 50%), la cantidad de Puños + 1 y debe golpear, al mismo tiempo invita a todos los ataques coordinados de Lightning Phantom. Al ingresar a Lightning Dharma, la bonificación de daño de todos los Pokémon de tipo Eléctrico aumenta un 30% durante 1 ronda.",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "출시 후 [Lighting Phantom]가 있으면 제라오라가 라이트닝 팬텀과 결합하여 2라운드 동안 [Lighting Dharma]이 됩니다\n 라이트닝 달마: 라이트닝 팬텀의 현재 속성이 60% 추가되고 회피가 50% 증가합니다. 활성 공격이 플라즈마 주먹(분노를 소모하지 않고, 분노를 회복하지만, 자신의 분노 속도를 50% 감소)으로 할 때마다 펀치 횟수가 1씩 증가하고 필연적으로 적중합니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "If there is [Lightning Phantom] after the release, combine with Lightning Phantom to become [Lightning Dharma] for 2 rounds\nLightning Dharma: add Lightning Phantom 60% of the current attribute, and increase the dodge by an additional 50%, each active attack is to release Plasma Fists (does not consume, restores rage but reduces its own Rage Recovery Speed by 50%), the number of Fists+1 and must hit, at the same time invites all Lightning Phantom coordinated attacks. When entering Lightning Dharma, the damage bonus of all Electric-type Pokémons is increased by 30% for 1 round",
		simDesc_kr = "제라오라는 양손에 수천 볼트의 전기를 모아 바람을 다스리는 속도로 순간적으로 5연타를 가해 적을 공격한다. 다른 적에게 타격을 가하면 [Static Field] 효과가 적용됩니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "เมื่อเข้าสู่ธรรมสายฟ้า โบนัส DMG ของโปเกมอนประเภทไฟฟ้าทั้งหมดจะเพิ่มขึ้น 30% เป็นเวลา 1 รอบ เมื่อปล่อย Plasma Fists ภายใต้ธรรมะสายฟ้า เชิญการโจมตีที่ประสานกันของ Lightning Phantom ทั้งหมด",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "번개달마에 들어갈 때 모든 전기타입 포켓몬의 데미지 보너스가 1라운드 동안 30% 증가합니다. 번개 달마 아래 플라즈마 주먹을 발사할 때 모든 번개 팬텀 협력 공격을 초대합니다.",
		starEffectDesc_en = "If there is a [Lighting Phantom] after the release, Zeraora will combine with the Lighting Phantom and become [Lighting Dharma] for 2 rounds\n Lighting Dharma: Adds 60% of the current attributes of Lightning Phantom, and increase evasion by 50%. Every time active attack is a Plasma Fist(does not consume, restores Rage,but reduces its own Rage speed by 50%), the number of punches is increased by 1 and inevitable hit",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "Ao entrar no Lightning Dharma, o bônus DMG de todos os Pokémon do tipo Elétrico aumenta em 30% por 1 rodada; ao liberar Plasma Fists sob Lightning Dharma, convide todos os ataques coordenados do Lightning Phantom",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "Saat memasuki Lightning Dharma, bonus DMG semua Pokémon tipe Listrik meningkat sebesar 30% selama 1 ronde; saat melepaskan Tinju Plasma di bawah Dharma Petir, undang semua serangan terkoordinasi Hantu Petir",
