		starEffectDesc_en = "If there is a [Lighting Phantom] after the release, Zeraora will combine with the Lighting Phantom and become [Lighting Dharma] for 2 rounds\n Lighting Dharma: Adds 60% of the current attributes of Lightning Phantom, and increase evasion by 50%. Every time active attack is a Plasma Fist(does not consume, restores Rage,but reduces its own Rage speed by 50%), the number of punches is increased by 1 and inevitable hit",
