#F40##L10# [Static Field]: #L0# During the period, get [Electrify] effect and there is a 50% chance of not being able to get Buff. After attacking, there is a 80% chance to [Paralysis] for 1 round. When Electric allies attack a target in the [Static Field], 25% of the skill DMG will be transferred to up to two [Magnetized] targets.]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "เมื่อเข้าสู่ธรรมสายฟ้า โบนัส DMG ของโปเกมอนประเภทไฟฟ้าทั้งหมดจะเพิ่มขึ้น 30% เป็นเวลา 1 รอบ เมื่อปล่อย Plasma Fists ภายใต้ธรรมะสายฟ้า เชิญการโจมตีที่ประสานกันของ Lightning Phantom ทั้งหมด",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "출시 후 [Lightning Phantom]이 있으면 라이트닝 팬텀과 합체하여 2라운드 동안 [Lightning Dharma]이 됩니다\n번개 달마: 라이트닝 팬텀 현재 속성의 60%를 추가하고, 활성 공격마다 회피가 추가로 50% 증가합니다. 플라즈마 주먹(소모하지 않고 분노를 회복하지만 자신의 분노 회복 속도를 50% 감소시킴), 주먹 횟수+1 및 반드시 적중해야 하는 동시에 모든 라이트닝 팬텀 협력 공격을 초대합니다. 전격달마에 진입하면 1라운드 동안 모든 전기타입 포켓몬의 대미지 보너스가 30% 증가합니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "번개달마에 들어갈 때 모든 전기타입 포켓몬의 데미지 보너스가 1라운드 동안 30% 증가합니다. 번개 달마 아래 플라즈마 주먹을 발사할 때 모든 번개 팬텀 협력 공격을 초대합니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "If there is [Lightning Phantom] after the release, combine with Lightning Phantom to become [Lightning Dharma] for 2 rounds\nLightning Dharma: add Lightning Phantom 60% of the current attribute, and increase the dodge by an additional 50%, each active attack is to release Plasma Fists (does not consume, restores rage but reduces its own Rage Recovery Speed by 50%), the number of Fists+1 and must hit, at the same time invites all Lightning Phantom coordinated attacks. When entering Lightning Dharma, the damage bonus of all Electric-type Pokémons is increased by 30% for 1 round",
		describe_kr = [[
#C0xDCDCDC#Feel the power of technology!#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#Zeraora uses high-tech roller skates to move at high speed and attack enemies 6 times, each time causes #C0xE69900#220%P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. If hits 3 different enemies, inflict [Static Field] effect on the enemies' field, lasting 1~2 big rounds
#F10# 
#F40##L10# [Static Field]: #L0# During the period, get [Electrify] effect and there is a 50% chance of not being able to get Buff. After attacking, there is a 80% chance to [Paralysis] for 1 round. When Electric allies attack a target in the [Static Field], 25% of the skill DMG will be transferred to up to two [Magnetized] targets.]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "Ao entrar no Lightning Dharma, o bônus DMG de todos os Pokémon do tipo Elétrico aumenta em 30% por 1 rodada; ao liberar Plasma Fists sob Lightning Dharma, convide todos os ataques coordenados do Lightning Phantom",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "Saat memasuki Lightning Dharma, bonus DMG semua Pokémon tipe Listrik meningkat sebesar 30% selama 1 ronde; saat melepaskan Tinju Plasma di bawah Dharma Petir, undang semua serangan terkoordinasi Hantu Petir",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "Se houver um [Lighting Phantom] após o lançamento, Zeraora se combinará com o Lightning Phantom e se tornará [Lighting Dharma] por 2 rodadas\n Lighting Dharma: Adiciona 60% dos atributos atuais do Lightning Phantom e aumenta a evasão em 50%. Cada vez que o ataque ativo é um Punho de Plasma (não consome, restaura a Fúria, mas reduz sua própria velocidade de Fúria em 50%), o número de socos aumenta em 1 e o acerto inevitável",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "Al ingresar a Lightning Dharma, la bonificación de DAÑO de todos los Pokémon de tipo Eléctrico aumenta en un 30% durante 1 ronda; al lanzar Plasma Fists bajo Lightning Dharma, invita a todos los ataques coordinados de Lightning Phantom",
		describe_th = [[
#C0xDCDCDC#สัมผัสถึงพลังของเทคโนโลยี!#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#Zeraora ใช้โรลเลอร์สเก็ตไฮเทคเพื่อเคลื่อนที่ด้วยความเร็วสูงและโจมตีศัตรู 6 ครั้ง ในแต่ละครั้งทำให้เกิด #C0xE69900#220%P พลังโจมตี#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. หากโดนศัตรู 3 ตัวที่แตกต่างกัน สร้างเอฟเฟกต์ [Static Field] บนสนามของศัตรู นาน 1~2 รอบใหญ่
#F10# 
