		describe_en = "After receiving an active skill, there is a #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to enter [Stealth] for 1 round (Triggers up to 1 time every 3 big rounds); Before the start of each big round, launch 1 spell at one random ally and one random enemy. When hits Ally, adds [Happiness] to it and increases its P.&SP.ATK by 30% for 2 rounds; When hits Enemy, has a 50% chance to inflict [Psychentonia] for 1 round (The more enemies in the battle, the higher the chance of inflicting [Psychentonia], up to 80%)",
