		describe_en = "Cobalion gathers the light of his body on its horn and releases light beam to attack an enemy single target, dealing#C0xE69900#160% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, two ally Pokémons with the lowest HP gets a 350% P.DEF Shield. When shield is broken, it will cause damage of Cobalion 150% P.DEF to all enemies, last for 2 rounds",
