		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "산봉우리에 선 코발리온이 직진하여 리더의 검으로 뒷줄의 적들을 강타하며 #C0xE69900#250% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, 2라운드 동안 모든 아군의 궁극 저항이 10% 증가하고(정의의 검 시리즈 및 강철형 포켓몬은 추가로 10% 증가) 모든 아군은 P.DEF 400% 코발리온의 보호막을 받습니다. 방패가 깨지면 적 전체에게 코발리온 160% P.DEF 피해를 주고 2라운드 동안 지속됩니다.",
		describe_en = "Cobalion stood up from the top of the mountain, then dashed straight down and slammed into the enemies in back row with the Sword of Leader, dealing#C0xE69900#250% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, increase Ult Resist of all allies by 10% for 2 rounds (Swords of Justice series and Steel-type Pokémons gets additional increase by 10%), and all the allies receive a shield of Cobalion 350% P.DEF. When shield is broken, it will cause damage of Cobalion 150% P.DEF to all enemies, last for 2 rounds",
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = "Cobalion berdiri di puncak gunung, berlari lurus ke bawah, menghantam musuh di barisan belakang dengan Pedang Pemimpin, menangani#C0xE69900#250% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, meningkatkan Ult Resist semua sekutu sebesar 10% selama 2 putaran (seri Swords of Justice dan Pokémon tipe Baja mendapat peningkatan tambahan sebesar 10%), dan semua sekutu menerima perisai Cobalion 400% P.DEF. Ketika perisai rusak, akan menimbulkan damage Cobalion 160% P.DEF ke semua musuh, bertahan selama 2 ronde",
