#F20#
#F40##L10#Diamond Wall:#L0#Semua perisai unit, dengan HP setara dengan total 200% P.&Sp.DEF Diancie. Untuk setiap peningkatan sekutu tipe Rock/Fairy Bonus DEF 100% (Tertinggi hingga 400%) Saat Tembok Berlian rusak, semua sekutu memulihkan HP setara dengan total 250% P.&Sp.DEF Diancie (Penyembuhan berlebih akan berubah menjadi perisai, dan mengurangi 20% P.&Sp. ATK ke semua sekutu selama 1 ronde]],
		simDesc_en = "Diancie summons a huge crystal, surrounding a single enemy target, while locking it within. It creates one crystal wall in front of all its allies which recovers some of the allies' HP when the wall is broken, and reduces the SP.ATK and P.ATK of all enemies",
		simDesc_vn = "Diancie invoca um enorme cristal, cercando um único alvo inimigo, enquanto o prende dentro dele. Ele cria uma parede de cristal na frente de todos os seus aliados que recupera parte do HP dos aliados quando a parede é quebrada e reduz o SP.ATK e P.ATK de todos os inimigos",
		describe_kr = [[
