		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Naganadel throws a venom ball high into the sky, which later explodes to drench enemies in a column in a poisonous liquid, dealing (#C0x3D8A99#300% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$) #C0xF13B54# SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#. Applies 1 layer of [Poison] for 3 rounds, and instantly concludes Poison DMG for 1 time. Deals 30% increased DMG to targets below 30% HP",
		simDesc_kr = "나가나델은 독구를 하늘 높이 던지며, 나중에 폭발하여 기둥에 있는 적을 독액으로 흠뻑 적시게 됩니다. 독을 주입하고 독 데미지를 1회 종료합니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#สร้างความเสียหายเพิ่มขึ้น 30% ไปยังเป้าหมายที่ HP ต่ำกว่า 30%",
