		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Keen Eye: Permanently increase Accuracy by #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B#%,Permanently increase own P.ATK by 20%; Before the start of each big round, has a 30% chance to enter [Stealth] for 1 big round.",
