#F20#
#F40##L10#Aura wave resonance:#L0#when allied Pokemon's attack is "very effective", increases itself by an additional 15% DMG bonus for 2 rounds.(Steel-type and fighting-type Pokemon have double effects) Every time allied Pokemon except itself move out of round（ Assist, Invite, Extra Skill, Combo, Counterattack, Extra Move),it gains a stack of Aura wave.]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#เมื่อได้รับคลื่นออร่า ความโกรธจะเพิ่มขึ้น 30",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "추가 효과:아군 포켓몬이 기본 공격을 사용하면 메가 루카리오가 적을 공격하는 데 도움이 됩니다. 각 어시스트 공격은 분노를 50씩 증가시킵니다. 분노가 가득 차면 분노를 소모하여 궁극기를 사용하여 지원합니다. 오라 파동은 분노를 30만큼 추가로 증가시킵니다.",
