		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "[Water Bubble] effect enhance:reduce Sustained DMG&Reflected DMG 60%;\nOcean Melody: increase Basic six stats by 40%; [Cloyster] buff: Recover [Cloyster] 30% HP; increase 20 % Rebound rate; Seadra buff:attack target with [Blind] 2 rounds:reduce 20% hit rate",
