		describe_en = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#Welcome to Sea Opera House!#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10#Wishiwashi Harass#L0#: Summons a Wishiwashi to harass random enemy target in Manaphy's action round, each Wishiwashi makes the enemy [Weak to Water]; When there is 5 Wishiwashi on the Enemy field, they will converge on the enemy with most Wishiwashi, forming a swarm of Wishiwashi to surround it, instantly dealing SP.DMG equal to 450% SP.ATK. The target besieged by the swarm cannot directly attack the enemy. After 1 active attack or 1 round, the swarm will be disbanded. 
#F10#
#F40#[Weak to Water]: 5% Water-Type vulnerability, reduced 5% DMG against Water-Type summons, can be stacked up to 5 layers. 
#F40##L10#Iron Guard#L0#: Summon a Cloyster when enter the battlefield at every 2 rounds(inherit Manaphy's 150% HP and 220% P.DEF), helping Manaphy to share #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$#C0x5B545B#% of the DMG taken and share Rage with Manaphy. When Manaphy's HP lower than 30% or suffer fatal DMG, Cloyster recovers 30% of its own HP and wraps Manaphy. When Cloyster is killed or next round ends, Manaphy retains 30% HP, gets out of the Cloyster, reflects 50% DMG taken during the period and the true DMG equal to Manaphy's 400% SP.ATK to all enemies. Gains an additional [Ice Trap] for 1 round. After that, Cloyster can no longer be summoned. 
#F10#
