#F40##L10#Iron Guard#L0#: Summon a Cloyster when enter the battlefield and every 3 rounds(inherit Manaphy's 200% HP and 220% P.DEF), helping Manaphy to share #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$#C0x5B545B#% of the DMG taken and share Rage with Manaphy. When Cloyster HP is lower than 35%, increase 50% DMG reduction of Cloyster until next summon(can be only trigger once). When Manaphy's HP lower than 30% or suffer fatal DMG, Cloyster recovers 30% of its own HP and wraps Manaphy. When Cloyster is killed or next round ends, Manaphy retains 30% HP, gets out of the Cloyster, reflects 50% DMG taken during the period and the true DMG equal to Manaphy's 400% SP.ATK to all enemies. Gains an additional [Ice Trap] for 1 round. After that, Cloyster can no longer be summoned. 
