#F40##L10# 결속의 힘:#L0# 필드에 입장할 때 모든 물 유형 또는 어둠 아군에 대해 해당 레이어 수 [Powerw of Bond](특수 효과, SP.ATK 및 체력 훔치기 2% 증가, 최대 20 레이어). 공격 지원 시 [Power of Bond] 1레이어를 얻습니다. 공격하거나 보호하도록 초대받으면 [Power of Bond]의 2레이어를 얻습니다. [Power of Bond]을 가질 때 Ash의 Greninja는 다른 아군이 전장에 있을 때 치명적인 DMG를 받을 때 죽음을 1라운드 지연시킵니다. [Power of Bond]가 20레이어에 도달하면 즉시 [Shadow Kill]에 진입하고 일시적으로 치명타율과 데미지가 100% 증가하고 즉시 [Golden Water Shuriken]를 출시합니다.]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "Waterspout는 모든 디버프를 해제하고 디버프 저항 및 면역 제어율을 60% 증가시키고 SP.ATK 데미지를 600% 흡수할 수 있습니다. [Power of Bond]가 20레이어에 도달하면 즉시 [Shadow Kill]을 입력하고 일시적으로 치명타율과 데미지를 100% 증가시키고 즉시 [Golden Water Shuriken]를 해제합니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#Ash! I Choose You!#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10#Ultimate Secret of Water Ninja:#L0# ingnore #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#SP.DEF of target whose Speed is lowewr than Ash's Greninja; The more Speed difference between itself and target, the more extra DMG. Increase 3% DMG for every 1% Speed, up to an additional 100%; 
 After attacking, there is a chance equal to the ratio of the Speed difference to inflict [Water Shuriken] mark to the target
 Water Shuriken: 10% Water Vulnerability. When an ally attack the target, Ash's Greninja will use basic attack to assist and consume target's Water Shuriken mark
#F10#
#F40##L10#Wave Sword:#L0# After Water Type allies moving, get 1 layer of [Wave]. When the Debuff and control effect on Ash's Greninja are dispelled or dispel enemies' Buff, get 1 layer of [Wave]. When the control effects end, get 4 layers of [Wave]. When reaching 6 layers, consume all the layers, arouse a [Waterspout] to wrap itself and dispel all Debuff (Waterspout: a shield that can absorb 600% SP.ATK DMG, increase Crit RES 100%, increase 30% Water Type skill DMG, increase 60% Debuff Resistance&Immune Control Rate,last until the shield is broken or the big round end).When [Waterspout] disappear, the water condenses from behind to form a giant Water Shuriken and get a new round. When with giant Water Shuriken, Ult skill can consume the giant Water Shuriken to release Rage, the effect CD is 2 rounds. 
 Wave: Special effect, increase 5% speed and 10% Cri RES.
#F10#
#F40##L10#Power of Bond:#L0# For every Water Type or Dark allies when enter field, get the corresponding number of layers [Powerw of Bond](special effect, increase 2% SP.ATK&Health Steal, up to 20 layers). Gain 1 layer of [Power of Bond] when assist attack. Gain 2 layers of [Power of Bond] when being invited to attack or protected. When having [Power of Bond], Ash's Greninja delay death by 1 round when take fatal DMG if other allies are on the battlefield. When the [Power of Bond] reaches 20 layers, immediately enter the [Shadow Kill], temporarily increase 100% Crit rate&DMG and immediately release a [Golden Water Shuriken].]],
