#F40#Ash's Greninja activates the ultimate secret of water ninja, and flies the giant golden water shuriken to an enemy(priority attack speed is the slowest), steals target's 30% Crit rate and 40% Crit DMG for 2 rounds, causing #C0x3D8A99#540%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, with 30% Health Steal. If target's Speed is lower than 40% or more of its own, or the target's HP is lower than 10% after the attack(including death), inflicts an additional [Wave Breaking Cut](only 2 times can be triggered) 
#F10#
#F40##C0x4682B4##L10#[Wave Breaking Cut]:#L0##C0x5B545B# deal #C0x3D8A99#60%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+10% of target's Max HP true DMG (does not exceed 1000% of Greninja's SP.ATK), the DMG to the PVE Pokemon is doubled and it must be triggered]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "the basic DMG is increased from 60% SP.ATK to 80% SP.ATK(increase 20% SP.ATK for each additional enemy) and dispel 1 Buff, If there is no Buff to dispel or the target has a speed type debuff, the target will be [Knock Back] for 1 round; Enter [Shadow Kill] state, immune target's all Ult Skill RES.",
		starEffectDesc_es = "Cada 3 ataques básicos entrarán en el estado [Shadow Kill] para invocar un [Water Shadow Team] como sustituto y fortalecer la siguiente habilidad definitiva, de modo que la habilidad definitiva tenga el efecto de [Water Shadow Link] \n#F10#\n#F40# #L10#Water Shadow Link:#L0# invoca hasta 5 [Water Shadow Team] en el aire (básico 2, por cada aumento del 15% en la velocidad inicial, se convocará un Water Shadow Team adicional), y todos liberan el Water Shuriken para atacar al enemigo, causa 200% SP.ATK DAÑO del Equipo Water Shadow.",
		starEffectDesc_th = "การโจมตีพื้นฐานทุกๆ 3 ครั้งจะเข้าสู่สถานะ [Shadow Kill] เพื่อเรียก [Water Shadow Team] มาทดแทน และเสริมความแข็งแกร่งให้กับทักษะอัลติเมทถัดไป เพื่อให้ทักษะอัลติสมีผลเป็น [Water Shadow Link] \n#F10#\n#F40# #L10#Water Shadow Link:#L0# เรียกได้สูงสุด 5 [Water Shadow Team] ขึ้นไปในอากาศ (พื้นฐาน 2 สำหรับการเพิ่มความเร็วเริ่มต้นทุกๆ 15% ทีมเงาน้ำเพิ่มเติมจะถูกอัญเชิญ) และทั้งหมดจะปล่อยชูริเคนน้ำ เพื่อโจมตีศัตรู สร้าง SP.ATK DMG 200% ของทีม Water Shadow",
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = "[Wave Breaking Cut] kali +1, DMG dasar ditingkatkan dari 60% SP.ATK menjadi 80% SP.ATK (meningkatkan 20% SP.ATK untuk setiap musuh tambahan) dan menghilangkan 1 Buff, Jika tidak ada Buff untuk menghilangkan atau target memiliki debuff tipe kecepatan, targetnya adalah [Knock Back] selama 1 putaran ; Setiap 3 serangan dasar akan memasuki keadaan [Shadow Kill] untuk memanggil 1 [Water Shadow Team] sebagai pengganti, dan memperkuat Skill Ult berikutnya, agar Skill Ult target kebal terhadap Skill Ult Skill RES dan mempunyai efek [Water Shadow Link] \n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Water Shadow Link:#L0# memanggil hingga 5 [Water Shadow Team] ke udara (dasar 2, untuk setiap peningkatan 15% pada Kecepatan awal, Tim Bayangan Air tambahan akan dipanggil), dan semuanya melepaskan Shuriken Air untuk menyerang musuh, menimbulkan 200% SP.ATK DMG pada Tim Bayangan Air.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "[Wave Breaking Cut] veces +1, el DAÑO básico aumenta de 60% SP.ATK a 80% SP.ATK (aumenta 20% SP.ATK por cada enemigo adicional) y disipa 1 Buff, si no hay ningún Buff para disipar o el el objetivo tiene una desventaja de tipo velocidad, el objetivo será [Knock Back] durante 1 ronda; Cada 3 ataques básicos entrarán en el estado [Shadow Kill] para invocar 1 [Water Shadow Team] como sustituto y fortalecer la siguiente habilidad definitiva, de modo que la habilidad definitiva del objetivo inmune a la habilidad definitiva RES y tenga el efecto de [Water Shadow Link] \n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Water Shadow Link:#L0# invoca hasta 5 [Water Shadow Team] en el aire (básico 2, por cada aumento del 15% en la Velocidad inicial, se convocará un Equipo Water Shadow adicional), y todos liberan el Water Shuriken para atacar al enemigo, causa 200% SP.ATK DAÑO del Water Shadow Team.",
		describe_en = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#Let you see our bond!! #C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#Ash's Greninja activates the ultimate secret of water ninja, and flies the giant golden water shuriken to an enemy(priority attack speed is the slowest), steals target's 30% Crit rate and 40% Crit DMG for 2 rounds, causing #C0x3D8A99#540%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, with 30% Health Steal. If target's Speed is lower than 40% or more of its own, or the target's HP is lower than 10% after the attack(including death), inflicts an additional [Wave Breaking Cut](only 2 times can be triggered) 
#F10#
#F40##C0x4682B4##L10#[Wave Breaking Cut]:#L0##C0x5B545B# deal #C0x3D8A99#60%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+10% of target's Max HP true DMG (does not exceed 1000% of Greninja's SP.ATK), the DMG to the PVE Pokemon is doubled and it must be triggered]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "ความเสียหายพื้นฐานเพิ่มขึ้นจาก 60% SP.ATK เป็น 80% SP.ATK (เพิ่ม SP.ATK 20% สำหรับศัตรูเพิ่มเติมแต่ละตัว) และลบล้างบัฟ 1 อัน หากไม่มีบัฟให้ลบล้างหรือเป้าหมายมีดีบัฟประเภทความเร็ว เป้าหมายจะเป็น [Knock Back] ต่อ 1 รอบ; เข้าสู่สถานะ [Shadow Kill] เป้าหมายภูมิคุ้มกันของ Ult Skill RES ทั้งหมด",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "[Wave Breaking Cut] times +1, the basic DMG is increased from 60% SP.ATK to 80% SP.ATK(increase 20% SP.ATK for each additional enemy) and dispel 1 Buff, If there is no Buff to dispel or the target has a speed type debuff, the target will be [Knock Back] for 1 round ; Every 3 basic attacks will enter the [Shadow Kill] state to summon 1 [Water Shadow Team] as a substitute, and strengthen the next Ult Skill, so that the Ult Skill immune target's Ult Skill RES and has the effect of [Water Shadow Link] \n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Water Shadow Link:#L0# summons up to 5 [Water Shadow Team] into the air (basic 2, for every 15% increase in the initial Speed, an additional Water Shadow Team will be summoned), and all release the Water Shuriken to attack enemy, deals 200% SP.ATK DMG of Water Shadow Team.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "기본 데미지가 60% SP.ATK에서 80% SP.ATK로 증가하고(추가 적 하나당 SP.ATK 20% 증가) 버프를 1개 해제합니다. 해제할 버프가 없거나 대상에게 속도형 디버프가 있는 경우, 1라운드 동안 목표는 [Knock Back]입니다. [Shadow Kill] 상태로 진입하면 면역 대상의 모든 궁극기 RES가 적용됩니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "[Wave Breaking Cut] times +1, the basic DMG is increased from 60% SP.ATK to 80% SP.ATK(increase 20% SP.ATK for each additional enemy) and dispel 1 Buff, If there is no Buff to dispel or the target has a speed type debuff, the target will be [Knock Back] for 1 round ; Every 3 basic attacks will enter the [Shadow Kill] state to summon 1 [Water Shadow Team] as a substitute, and strengthen the next Ult Skill, so that the Ult Skill immune target's Ult Skill RES and has the effect of [Water Shadow Link] \n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Water Shadow Link:#L0# summons up to 5 [Water Shadow Team] into the air (basic 2, for every 15% increase in the initial Speed, an additional Water Shadow Team will be summoned), and all release the Water Shuriken to attack enemy, deals 200% SP.ATK DMG of Water Shadow Team.",
		describe_kr = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#우리 인연 좀 보시죠!! #C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#애쉬의 그레닌자는 워터닌자의 궁극의 비밀을 발동시켜 거대한 황금수리검을 적에게 날리고(우선공격속도가 가장 느림) 타겟의 치명타율 30%와 40을 훔칩니다. 2라운드 동안 치명타 데미지 %, #C0x3D8A99#540%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, 30% 체력 강탈. 대상의 속도가 자신의 속도보다 40% 이상 낮거나, 공격 후 대상의 HP가 10% 미만인 경우(사망 포함) 추가 [Wave Breaking Cut](2회만 발동 가능) 
#F10# 
#F40##C0x4682B4##L10#[Wave Breaking Cut]:#L0##C0x5B545B# 거래 #C0x3D8A99#60%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+대상 최대 HP의 10% 실제 DMG(그레닌자의 1000%를 초과하지 않음) SP.ATK), PVE 포켓몬에 대한 DMG가 두 배가 되며 반드시 발동되어야 합니다.]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "o DMG básico é aumentado de 60% SP.ATK para 80% SP.ATK (aumenta 20% SP.ATK para cada inimigo adicional) e dissipa 1 Buff, se não houver nenhum Buff para dissipar ou o alvo tiver um debuff do tipo velocidade, a meta será [Knock Back] por 1 rodada; Entre no estado [Shadow Kill], o alvo imunológico é todo Ult Skill RES.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "DMG dasar ditingkatkan dari 60% SP.ATK menjadi 80% SP.ATK (meningkatkan 20% SP.ATK untuk setiap musuh tambahan) dan menghilangkan 1 Buff, Jika tidak ada Buff untuk menghilangkan atau target memiliki debuff tipe kecepatan, targetnya adalah [Knock Back] untuk 1 putaran; Masuk ke status [Shadow Kill], target kebal semua Ult Skill RES.",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "A cada 3 ataques básicos entrará no estado [Shadow Kill] para invocar um [Water Shadow Team] como substituto, e fortalecer a próxima Ult Skill, para que a Ult Skill tenha o efeito de [Water Shadow Link] \n#F10#\n#F40# #L10#Water Shadow Link:#L0# invoca até 5 [Water Shadow Team] no ar (básico 2, para cada 15% de aumento na velocidade inicial, uma equipe Water Shadow adicional será convocada), e todos liberam o Water Shuriken para atacar o inimigo, causa 200% SP.ATK DMG do Water Shadow Team.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "el DAÑO básico aumenta de 60% SP.ATK a 80% SP.ATK (aumenta 20% SP.ATK por cada enemigo adicional) y disipa 1 mejora. Si no hay ninguna mejora para disipar o el objetivo tiene una desventaja de tipo velocidad, el objetivo será [Knock Back] durante 1 ronda; Ingrese al estado [Shadow Kill], todas las habilidades definitivas del objetivo inmune RES.",
		describe_th = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#มาดูความผูกพันของเรากัน!! #C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#Greninja ของ Ash เปิดใช้งานสุดยอดความลับของนินจาน้ำ และชูริเคนน้ำสีทองขนาดยักษ์บินไปหาศัตรู (ความเร็วในการโจมตีจะช้าที่สุด) ขโมยอัตราคริติคอล 30% ของเป้าหมายและ 40 % ความเสียหายคริติคอล 2 รอบ ทำให้ #C0x3D8A99#540%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B# พร้อมขโมยสุขภาพ 30% หากความเร็วของเป้าหมายต่ำกว่า 40% หรือมากกว่านั้น หรือ HP ของเป้าหมายต่ำกว่า 10% หลังจากการโจมตี (รวมถึงการตาย) จะสร้างความเสียหายเพิ่มเติม [Wave Breaking Cut](สามารถทริกเกอร์ได้เพียง 2 ครั้งเท่านั้น) 
#F10# 
#F40##C0x4682B4##L10#[Wave Breaking Cut]:#L0##C0x5B545B# จัดการ #C0x3D8A99#60%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+10% ของ HP สูงสุดของเป้าหมาย ความเสียหายจริง (ไม่เกิน 1000% ของ Greninja's SP.ATK) ความเสียหายต่อโปเกมอน PVE จะเพิ่มขึ้นสองเท่า และจะต้องถูกกระตุ้น]],
		starEffectDesc_en = "Every 3 basic attacks will enter the [Shadow Kill] state to summon a [Water Shadow Team] as a substitute, and strengthen the next Ult Skill, so that the Ult Skill has the effect of [Water Shadow Link] \n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Water Shadow Link:#L0# summons up to 5 [Water Shadow Team] into the air (basic 2, for every 15% increase in the initial Speed, an additional Water Shadow Team will be summoned), and all release the Water Shuriken to attack enemy, deals 200% SP.ATK DMG of Water Shadow Team.",
		id = 33047
	},
