#F10#
#F40#Mega Diancie compresses carbon elements in the air into diamonds, causing #C0x3D8A99#500% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B# and #C0xF13B54#special damage#C0x5B545B# of $(skillLevel*4*90)$ to a single enemy target, sealing it for 1 round with 【Crystal Imprison】; and builds a 【Diamond Storm】 for the ally (see battle manual for details). When the Diamond Storm is broken, it restores the life of all friendly units with 60% SP.ATK bonus from Diancie (excess recovery will be converted into a shield), and forms a 【#L10#Diamond Wall Beam#L0#】 with 8% wall value to reflect #C0xFF6EC7#holy damage#C0x5B545B# to all enemy units. If in the light sword state after the ultimate move, it restores the trigger times of 【#L10#Sacred Sword Beam#L0#】(if full, it will be released once without consumption immediately), and makes the next trigger of 【#L10#Sacred Sword Beam#L0#】trigger an additional sword dance, causing #C0x3D8A99#80% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B# and #C0xFF6EC7#holy damage#C0x5B545B# of $(skillLevel*8000)$ to all enemy units. After the Diamond Storm in the ultimate move is broken, it randomly seals one enemy with 【#L10#Crystal Imprison#L0#】and triggers an additional 【Sacred Sword Beam】or 【Sword Dance】. 
