		starEffectDesc_en = "#L10# Triple Star Wall: #L0# When Mega Diancie receives a fatal injury, if there are still teammates on the field, Mega Diancie will still stand on the field, and cannot move at this time, but still support the triple [Diamond Storm] for teammates, and the HP of each star wall is the sum of 600% of Diancie's double attacks; If there is still a shield wall after 1 turn, you will be revived with full blood and anger and get 2 rounds [Diamond Wall], otherwise when the shield is broken, Mega Diancie will die (up to 1 trigger in the whole game)",
