		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "The Steam Fog will spread to 2 surrounding units for 1 round, and the dodge ratte of units in the Steam Fog will be increased by 35%; and when the Water Type/Fire Type allies in Steam Fog act, Volcanion will get 1 additional point of [Steam Power]",
