		simDesc_th = "ภูเขาไฟโจมตีศัตรูตัวเดียว สร้าง SP.DMG ลบล้างบัฟทั้งหมดและเพิ่ม [Evaporation] และใช้ [Wide Steam Eruption] เพื่อโจมตีศัตรูทั้งหมด ทำให้เกิด SP.DMG จากนั้น [Heat Wave Cyclone] ยังคงอยู่ในตำแหน่งสุ่ม",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Todos los Pokémon de tipo Fuego/Tipo Agua obtienen 3 puntos de [Steam Power]: todo el DAÑO de la habilidad Tipo Agua/Tipo Fuego: todos los enemigos aumentan en un 50%; Cada ataque activo de un aliado consume 1 punto de [Steam Power] para obtener 100 de ira e inflige [Evaporation] al enemigo durante 2 rondas; [Heat Wave Cyclone] Cuando el ciclón causa daño fatal a Volcanion, retendrá 1 HP sobreviva y hay un 100% de posibilidades de que el ciclón permanezca en una posición aleatoria en el campo después de la detonación (se puede activar hasta 3 veces en toda la batalla). ), Cuando el ciclón detona, causa daño adicional elemental de agua/fuego equivalente al 3% del HP máximo del objetivo a unidades con [Evaporation]; El DAÑO causado a Volcanion por las unidades afectadas en [Wide Steam Eruption] disminuirá un 30% en las próximas 2 rondas. El daño elemental adjunto a [Wide Steam Eruption] en [Water and Fire] aumenta en un 50%",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "모든 불 유형/물 유형 포켓몬은 [Steam Power] 3점을 얻습니다: 물 유형/불 유형 스킬의 모든 데미지-모든 적 50% 증가; 각 아군 활성 공격은 [Steam Power] 1포인트를 소비하여 100 분노를 얻고 2라운드 동안 적에게 [Evaporation]를 입힙니다. [Heat Wave Cyclone] 사이클론이 볼케니온에 치명적인 피해를 입힐 때 생존 HP는 1 유지되며, 폭발 후 사이클론이 필드의 무작위 위치에 남아 있을 확률이 30%입니다(전체 전투에서 최대 2번 발동 가능) ); [Wide Steam Eruption]에서 영향을 받은 유닛이 Volcanion으로 인한 피해는 다음 2라운드 동안 30% 감소합니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "All Fire Type/Water Type Pokemon get 3 points of [Steam Power]: all DMG of Water Tpye/Fire Type skill-All Enemies increases by 50%; Each ally active attack, consumes 1 point of [Steam Power] to get 100 Rage, and inflicts [Evaporation] to enemy for 2 rounds; [Heat Wave Cyclone] When the Cyclone causes fatal DMG to Volcanion, it will retain 1 HP survives, and there is 100% chance that the cyclone will remain in a random position on the field after detonation(can be triggered up to 3 times in whole battle), When the cyclone detonates, deals additional Water/Fire Elemental DMG equal to 3% of target's Max HP to units with [Evaporation]; The DMG caused to Volcanion by the affected units in [Wide Steam Eruption] will decrease 30% in the next 2 rounds. The Elemental DMG attached to [Wide Steam Eruption] in [Water and Fire] is increased by 50%",
		simDesc_kr = "볼케니온은 적 하나를 공격해 SP.DMG를 주고 모든 버프를 해제하고 [Evaporation]를 추가하고 [Wide Steam Eruption]을 사용하여 모든 적을 공격하여 SP.DMG를 발생시킵니다. 그런 다음 [Heat Wave Cyclone]는 임의의 위치에 남아 있습니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#มีโอกาส 100% ที่พายุไซโคลนจะยังคงอยู่ในตำแหน่งสุ่มบนสนามหลังการระเบิด (สามารถกระตุ้นได้สูงสุด 3 ครั้งตลอดการต่อสู้) ความเสียหายธาตุที่แนบมากับ [Wide Steam Eruption] ใน [Water and Fire] เพิ่มขึ้น 50%; เมื่อพายุไซโคลนระเบิด จะสร้างความเสียหายเพิ่มเติมของธาตุน้ำ/ไฟเท่ากับ 3% ของ HP สูงสุดของเป้าหมายให้กับยูนิตที่มี [Evaporation]",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970#폭발 후 사이클론이 필드의 무작위 위치에 남아있을 확률은 100%입니다(전체 전투에서 최대 3번 발동 가능). [Wide Steam Eruption]의 [Water and Fire]에 부착된 원소 피해량이 50% 증가합니다. 사이클론이 폭발하면 [Evaporation]을 가진 유닛에게 대상 최대 HP의 3%에 해당하는 물/불의 정령 DMG를 추가로 줍니다.",
		starEffectDesc_en = "All Fire Type/Water Type Pokemon get 3 points of [Steam Power]: all DMG of Water Tpye/Fire Type skill-All Enemies increases by 50%; Each ally active attack, consumes 1 point of [Steam Power] to get 100 Rage, and inflicts [Evaporation] to enemy for 2 rounds; [Heat Wave Cyclone] When the Cyclone causes fatal DMG to Volcanion, it will retain 1 HP survives, and there is 30% chance that the cyclone will remain in a random position on the field after detonation(can be triggered up to 2 times in whole battle); The DMG caused to Volcanion by the affected units in [Wide Steam Eruption] will decrease 30% in the next 2 rounds.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "#C0x5c9970#Há 100% de chance do ciclone permanecer em uma posição aleatória no campo após a detonação (pode ser acionado até 3 vezes em toda a batalha); O DMG Elemental anexado a [Wide Steam Eruption] em [Water and Fire] é aumentado em 50%; Quando o ciclone detona, causa DMG Elemental de Água/Fogo adicional igual a 3% do HP máximo do alvo para unidades com [Evaporation]",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "#C0x5c9970#Ada 100% kemungkinan siklon akan tetap berada di posisi acak di lapangan setelah ledakan (dapat dipicu hingga 3 kali dalam seluruh pertempuran); Elemental DMG yang melekat pada [Wide Steam Eruption] di [Water and Fire] ditingkatkan sebesar 50%; Saat topan meledak, menimbulkan DMG Elemen Air/Api tambahan sebesar 3% dari Maks HP target kepada unit dengan [Evaporation]",
		id = 36513,
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "#C0x5c9970#Existe un 100 % de posibilidades de que el ciclón permanezca en una posición aleatoria en el campo después de la detonación (puede activarse hasta 3 veces en toda la batalla); El Daño elemental adjunto a [Wide Steam Eruption] en [Water and Fire] aumenta en un 50%; Cuando el ciclón detona, causa daño adicional elemental de agua/fuego equivalente al 3 % del HP máximo del objetivo a las unidades con [Evaporation]",
		simDesc_id = "Volcanion menyerang satu musuh, menimbulkan SP.DMG, menghilangkan semua Buffnya dan menambahkan [Evaporation], dan menggunakan [Wide Steam Eruption] untuk menyerang semua musuh, menyebabkan SP.DMG; Maka [Heat Wave Cyclone] tetap berada pada posisi acak"
