#F10#
#F40##L10#Nightmare:#L0#Negative effect that needs to be dispelled 3 times.The endless dark night block the target's field of vision, randomly reducing the attacking select range of the target by 1(not less then 1). The attack and the additional effect would not affect to the target out of the selecting range. During the [Nightmare] period,The ally ghost would be [shadow hide] for the target of the [nightmare],and ever attack by the Gengar will drain 50 rage of the target.]],
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = [[
