		simDesc_kr = "샤이니 메가 젠가는 유령책을 넘기며 그 뒤의 적 2명을 차례대로 유령 도시로 유인하여 유령 도시의 고통을 받게 합니다. 그리고 대상에게 [Nightmare]을 적용합니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#เอฟเฟกต์ฝันร้ายเพิ่มขึ้น: ดำเนินต่อไปอีก 1 รอบ และระยะการมองเห็นลดลงเหลือ 1 เป้าหมาย เก็นการ์เมก้ามันเงาจะเข้าสู่ [shadow hide] สำหรับเป้าหมาย [Grudge Poison]",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970#악몽 효과 강화: 1라운드 동안 계속되고 시야 범위는 1개 목표로 감소합니다. 반짝이는 메가 젠가는 [shadow hide] 목표에 대해 [Grudge Poison]에 들어갑니다.",
		starEffectDesc_en = "Welcome to the Cabin of Gengar\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Cursed Haunted House:#L0# When the ally that can not [shadow hide] exist,makes one of them disguised as [Cursed of Haunted House].And if there are no allies that can not [shadow hide] and there is empty space on ally, a [Cursed of Haunted House] will be summoned on the empty space.The target that attack the haunted house first will be sucked into the house before the attack, and enter the state of [madness],then the Cursed of Haunted House will disapper. (madness: special negative effect that can not be dispelled,and can not attack Gengar.Will hurt itself when is at his round or the Gengar moves,dealing with 150% of the target's P.ATK true DMG. The Gengar immunes to the madness)",
