#F40#[Shadow hide]:Ghost- ประเภทสถานะล่องหน หายไปจากระยะการโจมตีของศัตรู ไม่สามารถเลือกหรือรับผลได้]],
		starEffectDesc_en = "#L10#Phantasm Backstab：#L0#When the enemy pokemon defeated, the Gengar will takes its shadow and disguise itself as an undead enemy to take its place in the enemy. After its next move,additionally performs a backstap on an enemy,dealing 400%SP.ATK and inflicting [nightmare] for 3 rounds.If the target is poisoned, the damage will converted to true damage,and additionally drain its 50% current rage.(can be triggered 2 times)",
