		describe_en = "Lunala attacks a single enemy to deal #C0x3D8A99#160%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, after that it makes itself and 1 ghost ally with highest attack get into the 【moonshadows】for 1 round and also obtain DMG Bonus by 15%\n#F10#\n#F40# 【moonshadows】: Special effect, cannot be selected as a skill target, when sufferring non-contributory damage, will reduce this damage by 15% and recover Lunala Max HP by 10% （up to 500%SP.ATK）, after 【moonshadows】ends Lunala will enter into 【invisibility】for 1 round",
