		starEffectDesc_en = "Additional effect: when useing general attack to fight back,100% P.DEF additional damage of is added. 【Hardening】reaches 5 stacks, it will be converted to 5 stacks【invincible】for 2 rounds, this effectc can only be triggered 1 time \n#F10#\n#F40#【invincible】: Immune to any damage, 1 stack will be lost each time when itself is under active attack or is attacked by extra action.",
