		describe_kr = "Pheromosa flies across the ground at great speed, kicking towards a single enemy with astonishing speed and power, dealing#C0xE69900#550% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, and deals [Bug Trace] for 3 rounds, additionally gets 1 new round if the SPD of the target is more lower\n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Bug Trace:#L0#Negative effect, 35% Bug Vulnerability, Bug-type Pokémon will be additionally affected by Pheromosa#C0x3D8A99#100% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#of Bug-type SP.DMG",
