Entra en estado Rampage e inmediatamente atrapa el 30% de la resistencia crítica de la primera fila del enemigo durante 3 rondas
 Necrozma es inmune al efecto [Snagging]
#F10#
#F40##L10# Armadura de prisma: #L0# Prisma La armadura solo recibe un 50 % de daño, el daño restante se reducirá en un 50 % y luego se distribuirá para que los compañeros de equipo lo distribuyan uniformemente (el daño no se compartirá nuevamente); La armadura prisma puede absorber el 50% del daño antilesiones recibido y convertirlo en vida propia; La armadura pesada se vuelve inmune a la velocidad caótica, y cada compañero de equipo de la súper serie cuya velocidad es mayor que él reduce su velocidad en un 5% y aumenta su daño en un 5%.]],
		describe_en = [[
#C0xC0C0C0# I illuminate the darkness, so I become the darkness#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10# Penetrating light: #L0# Active attack will cause #C0xF13B54# SP.ATK Penetration Damage#C0x5B545B#, and release penetrating light to penetrate a layer of units behind the main target in this column, and the skill power will decrease by 30% layer by layer; When crit, it can penetrate targets in this column 5 layers (full shield, summons, etc. are considered 1 layer)
Penetrating light If it encounters a refracted object (refractive prism, diamond Imprison, Crystal Imprison, etc.), the light will scatter three rays, causing 60% skill power #C0xF13B54#SP.ATK penetration damage #C0x5B545B#; 
[SP.ATK Penetration Damage]: Ignores 50% of SP.DEF, Damage Reduction, Final Damage Reduction
#F10#
#F40##L10#Light Source Snagging: #L0# Before the start of each big round, [Snagging] 1 random non-dominant control (up to 3) that is higher than the attached enemy's skill, and in the next 3 rounds, immune to this control (3-round cooldown)
When the [Snagging] effect is generated, permanently reduces the target's Crit Resistance by 10%, and gains 1 bar of [Light Energy]. Each block of [Light Energy] increases 10% Crit, 6% SP.ATK and 100 Rage (up to 5 tiles), and when the storage is full, it will release all [Light Energy] after its own action to form a [Photon Geyser]: emits an unattenuated penetrating ray to each column, causing #C0x5c9970#$(200+skillLevel*0.5-0.5)$%#C0x5B545B#Sp.Attack's #C0xF13B54#Penetration damage#C0x5B545B#. Each block of overflowing [Light Energy] will escape, forming an unattenuated penetrating light, causing 140% SP.ATK #C0xF13B54# Penetrating Damage #C0x5B545B#; 
Necrozma is immune to [Snagging] effect
#F10#
#F40##L10# Prism Armor: #L0# Prism Armor only takes 50% damage, the remaining damage will be reduced by 50% and then scattered out to be evenly distributed by teammates (the damage will not be shared again); Prism armor can absorb 50% of the anti-injury damage received and convert it into its own life; Heavy armor makes itself immune to chaotic speed, and each super-series teammate whose speed is higher than itself reduces its speed by 5% and increases its damage by 5%]],
