#F10#
#F40##L10#Gravitational Trap: #L0#When an enemy in the back row without a target in the front row acts, the current move is invalidated and will move to the front row vacancy; The first enemy to move in the front row will be unable to move for 1 round due to Gravity Attraction and takes 300% SP.ATK trap damage. Gravitational Trap not working after triggering Gravity Attraction
