		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Stakataka stomps the ground and causes a mountain to rise, attacking a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#100% P.DMG#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B#. It gains an additional [Stack], and has a 30% chance to use its body to [Suppress] the target for 1 round (does not work on bosses). If it fails, it will increase its own P.ATK by 30% (stackable up to 3 times) until the next Lethal Skill is used.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10#Suppress: #L0#A control effect that cannot be dispelled, preventing the target from attacking or affecting targets other than Stakataka.",
