		describe_en = "Scorbunny attacks a single enemy, causing #C0xE69900#160%P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, increasing 100% Hit rate for 2 rounds. It inflicts [Burn] to enemy for 3 rounds. (Burn: Debuff,deals P.DMG equal to 40% Scorbunny's P.ATK to the target before the action, stacks up to 5 times and lasts for 3 rounds)",
