		describe_en = "Raboot attacks a single enemy, causing #C0xE69900#520%P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$#C0xF13B54# P.DMG#C0x5B545B#, consuming all [Fire Energy] to gather a fireball and kick it out, ejecting a number of times equal to the number of layers of [Fire Energy] in the enemy(priority eject target with [Burn]). Each time cause Fire DMG equal to 120% P.ATK. When the fireball hit the target with [Burn], it will immediately cause Fire DMG equal to 150% P.ATK, can be Crited; After using Ult skill, the fireball will stay by it side for 2 rounds, and each attack will bounce twice, causing Fire DMG equal to 100% P.ATK.",
