#F40##L10#Shield Wall Defense: #L0#Aura skill. Enhances Defense Rate by #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# and reduces damage taken by 10% for self and cross-range allies (Fighting-type Pokémon receive double the effect). For the first 5 rounds, gain a [Focus Shield] equal to 25% of max HP before each major round or when self triggers a block, lasting for 1 round.
