		simDesc_th = "Shiny Mega Gengar พลิกดูหนังสือผี นำศัตรูสองคนถัดไปที่อยู่ข้างหลังมันตามลำดับเข้าไปในเมืองผี ทำให้พวกเขาต้องทนทุกข์ทรมานจากความทรมานของเมืองผี และใช้ [Nightmare] กับเป้าหมาย",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#Aquí, tu dolor nunca terminará#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#Shiny Mega GengarViajas entre mundos humanos y fantasmas, destrozas el mundo, traes a los dos últimos objetivos enemigos en la secuencia de sus acciones. en el dominio fantasma ininterrumpido, y causa #C0x3D8A99#320%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel *4*60)$ #C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, y aplica [Nightmare] durante 2 rondas
#F10#
 #F40##L10#Pesadilla: #L0#Especial negativo, debe disiparse 3 veces, la interminable noche oscura bloquea la visión, por lo que el rango de selección del ataque objetivo se reduce a solo 1, y el ataque y los efectos incidentales no se aplicará a objetivos fuera del rango de selección; durante el período del sobre [Nightmare], los fantasmas del propio grupo están en el estado de [hidden shadow] contra el objetivo [Nightmare], y Gengar absorberá 50 puntos de ira del objetivo cada vez que ataque; Dentro de 1 ronda después del nirvana, Shiny Mega Gengar también entrará en el [hidden shadow] contra el objetivo malicioso del enemigo.]],
		starEffectDesc_kr = "Gengar의 오두막에 오신 것을 환영합니다\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# 저주받은 유령의 집:#L0# [shadow hide] 존재할 수 없는 아군이 존재할 때 그 중 하나를 [Cursed of Haunted House]로 위장하게 만듭니다.그리고 거기에 있다면 할 수 없는 아군은 없습니다[shadow hide] 그리고 아군에 빈 공간이 있으면 그 빈 공간에 [Cursed of Haunted House]이 소환됩니다. 유령의 집을 먼저 공격한 대상은 공격 전에 집 안으로 빨려들어가서 집 안으로 들어가게 됩니다. [madness] 상태가 되면 유령의 집의 저주가 사라질 것입니다. (광기: 해제할 수 없고 젠가를 공격할 수 없는 특수 부정적인 효과. 라운드에 있거나 젠가가 움직일 때 스스로 상처를 입으며 대상의 P.ATK 실제 데미지의 150%를 처리합니다. 젠가는 광기에 면역입니다. )",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#Here, your pain will never end#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40#Shiny Mega GengarYou travel between human and ghost worlds, tear the world apart, bring the last two enemy targets in the sequence of their actions into the uninterrupted ghost domain, and cause #C0x3D8A99#320%SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel *4*60)$’s #C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, and apply [Nightmare] for 2 rounds
#F10#
#F40##L10#Nightmare: #L0#Special negative, need to be dispelled 3 times, the endless dark night blocks the vision, so that the selection range of the target attack is reduced to only 1, and the attack and incidental effects will not be applied to targets outside the selection range; during the [Nightmare] envelope period , the ghosts of one’s own party are in the state of [hidden shadow] against the [Nightmare] target, and Gengar will absorb 50 points of anger from the target every time he attacks; within 1 round after the nirvana, Shiny Mega Gengar will also enter the [hidden shadow] against the enemy’s Maliceous target]],
		simDesc_kr = "샤이니 메가 젠가는 유령책을 넘기며 그 뒤의 적 2명을 차례대로 유령 도시로 유인하여 유령 도시의 고통을 받게 합니다. 그리고 대상에게 [Nightmare]을 적용합니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#เอฟเฟกต์ฝันร้ายเพิ่มขึ้น: ดำเนินต่อไปอีก 1 รอบ และระยะการมองเห็นลดลงเหลือ 1 เป้าหมาย เก็นการ์เมก้ามันเงาจะเข้าสู่ [shadow hide] สำหรับเป้าหมาย [Grudge Poison]",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970#악몽 효과 강화: 1라운드 동안 계속되고 시야 범위는 1개 목표로 감소합니다. 반짝이는 메가 젠가는 [shadow hide] 목표에 대해 [Grudge Poison]에 들어갑니다.",
		starEffectDesc_en = "Welcome to the Cabin of Gengar\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Cursed Haunted House:#L0# When the ally that can not [shadow hide] exist,makes one of them disguised as [Cursed of Haunted House].And if there are no allies that can not [shadow hide] and there is empty space on ally, a [Cursed of Haunted House] will be summoned on the empty space.The target that attack the haunted house first will be sucked into the house before the attack, and enter the state of [madness],then the Cursed of Haunted House will disapper. (madness: special negative effect that can not be dispelled,and can not attack Gengar.Will hurt itself when is at his round or the Gengar moves,dealing with 150% of the target's P.ATK true DMG. The Gengar immunes to the madness)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "#C0x5c9970#O efeito de pesadelo aumenta: continua por mais 1 rodada e o alcance de visão é reduzido para 1 alvo. O Shiny Mega Gengar entra no [shadow hide] para o alvo [Grudge Poison]",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "#C0x5c9970#Efek mimpi buruk ditingkatkan: berlanjut selama 1 putaran lagi, dan jangkauan penglihatan dikurangi menjadi 1 target. Shiny Mega Gengar masuk ke [shadow hide] untuk target [Grudge Poison]",
		id = 70223,
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "#C0x5c9970#El efecto de pesadilla mejora: continúa durante 1 ronda más y el rango de visión se reduce a 1 objetivo. El Shiny Mega Gengar entra en el [shadow hide] ​​para el [Grudge Poison] objetivo.",
		simDesc_id = "Shiny Mega Gengar membalik-balik buku hantu, memimpin dua musuh berikutnya di belakangnya secara bergantian ke kota hantu, membuat mereka menderita siksaan kota hantu. Dan menerapkan [Nightmare] ke target"
