		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "#C0x5c9970#Phantasm sneak enhance: provide protect when there are ghost type ally in the field.The attack Ingnores the terrain effect . [Phantasm Backstab] ratio increases to 500%, when disguise as the shadow of the enemy, can obtain some buff from the enemy.",
		starEffectDesc_es = "#L10#Phantasm Backstab:#L0#Cuando el Pokémon enemigo es derrotado, Gengar tomará su sombra y se disfrazará de enemigo no-muerto para ocupar su lugar entre el enemigo. Después de su siguiente movimiento, además realiza un golpe en la espalda a un enemigo, causando 400% SP.ATK e infligiendo [nightmare] durante 3 rondas. Si el objetivo está envenenado, el daño se convertirá en daño verdadero y, además, drenará su 50% de ira actual. .(se puede activar 2 veces)",
		starEffectDesc_th = "#L10#Phantasm Backstab：#L0#เมื่อโปเกมอนศัตรูพ่ายแพ้ เก็นการ์จะใช้เงาของมันและปลอมตัวเป็นศัตรูอันเดดเพื่อเข้ามาแทนที่ศัตรู หลังจากการเคลื่อนที่ครั้งถัดไป ทำการแทงข้างหลังศัตรูเพิ่มเติม สร้าง 400%SP.ATK และสร้างความเสียหาย [nightmare] เป็นเวลา 3 รอบ หากเป้าหมายถูกวางยาพิษ ความเสียหายจะเปลี่ยนเป็นความเสียหายจริง และระบายความโกรธปัจจุบันอีก 50% .(สามารถเปิดใช้งานได้ 2 ครั้ง)",
		zawakeEffectDesc_id = "#L10#Phantasm Backstab：#L0#Saat pokemon musuh dikalahkan, Gengar akan mengambil bayangannya dan menyamar sebagai musuh undead untuk mengambil tempatnya di dalam musuh. Setelah gerakan berikutnya, ia juga melakukan backstap pada musuh, menimbulkan 500% SP.ATK dan menimbulkan [nightmare] selama 3 ronde. Jika target terkena racun, kerusakannya akan diubah menjadi kerusakan sebenarnya, dan juga menguras 50% kemarahannya saat ini. .(dapat dipicu 2 kali)Selama penyamaran, dapat memperoleh sejumlah buff dari musuh. \nPeningkatan diam-diam hantu: memberikan perlindungan ketika ada sekutu tipe hantu di lapangan. Serangan Mengabaikan efek medan.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "#L10#Phantasm Backstab:#L0#Cuando el Pokémon enemigo es derrotado, Gengar tomará su sombra y se disfrazará de enemigo no-muerto para ocupar su lugar entre el enemigo. Después de su siguiente movimiento, además realiza un golpe en la espalda a un enemigo, causando 500% SP.ATK e infligiendo [nightmare] durante 3 rondas. Si el objetivo está envenenado, el daño se convertirá en daño verdadero y, además, drenará su 50% de ira actual. .(Se puede activar 2 veces) Durante el disfraz, puedes obtener algo de beneficio del enemigo. \nMejora furtiva de fantasma: brinda protección cuando hay un aliado de tipo fantasma en el campo. El ataque ignora el efecto del terreno.",
		describe_en = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#You will always receive my Malicious Curse#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10#Energy absorption: #L0#Each attack absorbs 20% of the current anger of the target. If the anger absorbed is less than 100 points, an additional layer of [Malice] will be added to the target; every time the enemy loses 150 points of anger on the field, the flash super Gengar will absorb 12 of it 0% special attack damage HP, and add 1 layer of 【Malice】
#F10#
#F40##L10#Cursed Body: #L0# Immune to random speed; units attacking Shiny Mega Gengar will fall into [Malice] state for 2 rounds (when attacked by ghosts and poisonous teammates, it will be extended for 1 round), and each layer of Malice reduces the damage received by the poisonous system by 18%
#F10#
#F40##L10#Ghost Stealth: #L0# When there are teammates in the front row, the shadow of the teammates will provide shelter for Shiny Mega Gengar: For enemies whose anger is lower than 50%, Shiny Mega Gengar will be in the [Shadow Hidden] state, and the damage done to them will increase #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B#
#F20#
#F40#【 Malice]: Negative effect, can only be dispelled, the target loses 50% of Gengar's special attack before each round #C0x9933CC#毒element damage#C0x5B545B#, the upper limit is 5 layers, if it is dispelled, it will immediately detonate 1.5 times the poison damage; when it reaches the 3rd layer, it will lose its 100 anger, and add [Visual Toxin] for 1 round
#F10#
#F40#【Visual Toxin】: Control effect, cannot be dispelled, target Before the round, there is an 80% chance to regard a random teammate as Shiny Mega Gengar, and force it to attack with a normal attack
#F10#
#F40#【Shadow Hidden】: The ghost is invisible, disappearing from the enemy's active attack vision, and cannot be selected and added effects]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "#C0x5c9970#Phantasm แอบเพิ่มประสิทธิภาพ: ให้การปกป้องเมื่อมีพันธมิตรประเภทผีอยู่ในสนาม การโจมตีไม่สนใจเอฟเฟกต์ภูมิประเทศ [Phantasm Backstab] อัตราส่วนเพิ่มขึ้นเป็น 500% เมื่อปลอมตัวเป็นเงาของศัตรู สามารถรับบัฟจากศัตรูได้",
		zawakeEffectDesc_kr = "#L10#Phantasm Backstab:#L0#적 포켓몬이 패배하면 Gengar는 그림자를 취하고 언데드 적으로 변장하여 적의 자리를 차지합니다. 다음 공격 후 추가로 적에게 백스탭을 수행하여 500% SP.ATK를 입히고 3라운드 동안 [nightmare]를 입힙니다. 대상이 중독된 경우 피해는 고정 피해로 전환되고 현재 분노의 50%를 추가로 흡수합니다. .(2회 발동 가능) 변장 중 적으로부터 일정 버프를 얻을 수 있습니다. \n판타즘 몰래 강화: 필드에 유령형 아군이 있을 때 보호 기능을 제공합니다. 공격은 지형 효과를 무시합니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "#C0x5c9970#판타즘 몰래 강화: 필드에 유령형 아군이 있을 때 보호 기능을 제공합니다. 공격은 지형 효과를 무시합니다. [Phantasm Backstab] 비율이 500%로 증가하며, 적의 그림자로 변장하면 적으로부터 일정 버프를 얻을 수 있습니다.",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "#L10#Phantasm Backstab：#L0#When the enemy pokemon defeated, the Gengar will takes its shadow and disguise itself as an undead enemy to take its place in the enemy. After its next move,additionally performs a backstap on an enemy,dealing 500%SP.ATK and inflicting [nightmare] for 3 rounds.If the target is poisoned, the damage will converted to true damage,and additionally drain its 50% current rage.(can be triggered 2 times)During the disguise, can obtain some buff from the enemy. \nPhantasm sneak enhance: provide protect when there are ghost type ally in the field.The attack Ingnores the terrain effect .",
		describe_kr = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#당신은 언제나 나의 악의적 저주를 받게 될 것입니다#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10#에너지 흡수: #L0#각 공격은 대상의 현재 분노의 20%를 흡수합니다. 흡수된 분노가 100점 미만인 경우 대상에 [Malice]의 추가 레이어가 추가됩니다. 적이 필드에서 150의 분노를 잃을 때마다 플래시 슈퍼 젠가는 그 중 12개를 흡수하고 0% 특수 공격 대미지 HP를 흡수하고 【악의】
#F10#
#F40##L10#를 1겹 추가합니다. 저주받은 몸: #L0# 임의 속도에 면역입니다. 샤이니 메가 젠가를 공격하는 유닛은 2라운드 동안 [Malice] 상태에 빠지고(유령 및 유독한 팀원에게 공격을 받으면 1라운드 동안 연장됩니다), 악의의 각 층마다 유독 시스템으로 받는 피해가 18%씩 감소합니다
#F10#
#F40##L10#고스트 스텔스: #L0# 앞줄에 팀원이 있을 때 팀원의 그림자가 샤이니 메가 젠가에게 은신처를 제공합니다: 분노가 50% 미만인 적의 경우, 빛나는 메가 젠가는 [Shadow Hidden] 상태가 되며, 그들에게 가해지는 피해는 증가합니다 #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B#
#F20#
#F40#【 악의]: 부정적인 효과, 해제되면 대상은 매 라운드 전에 Gengar의 특수 공격의 50%를 잃습니다 #C0x9933CC#毒요소 피해#C0x5B545B#, 상한은 5겹이며, 해제되면 즉시 독 피해의 1.5배를 폭발시킵니다. 3층에 도달하면 분노가 100이 되고 1라운드에 [Visual Toxin]가 추가됩니다
#F10#
#F40#【시각적 독소】: 제어 효과, 해제 불가, 대상 라운드 전, 있음 80% 확률로 무작위 팀원을 샤이니 메가 젠가로 간주하여 강제로 일반 공격으로 공격하게 합니다
#F10#
#F40#【그림자 숨김】: 유령이 투명해지며, 적의 적극적인 공격에서 사라집니다. 비전이며, 선택 및 효과 추가가 불가능합니다.]],
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "#C0x5c9970#Aprimoramento furtivo fantasma: fornece proteção quando há aliados do tipo fantasma no campo. O ataque ignora o efeito do terreno. [Phantasm Backstab] a proporção aumenta para 500%, quando disfarçado como a sombra do inimigo, pode obter algum buff do inimigo.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_id = "#C0x5c9970#Peningkatan diam-diam hantu: memberikan perlindungan ketika ada sekutu tipe hantu di lapangan. Serangan Mengabaikan efek medan. [Phantasm Backstab] rasio meningkat menjadi 500%, ketika menyamar sebagai bayangan musuh, dapat memperoleh beberapa buff dari musuh.",
		starEffectDesc_vn = "#L10#Phantasm Backstab：#L0#Quando o Pokémon inimigo é derrotado, o Gengar pega sua sombra e se disfarça como um inimigo morto-vivo para tomar seu lugar no inimigo. Após seu próximo movimento, adicionalmente executa um backstap em um inimigo, causando 400% de SP.ATK e infligindo [nightmare] por 3 rodadas. Se o alvo estiver envenenado, o dano será convertido em dano verdadeiro e, adicionalmente, drenará 50% de sua raiva atual. .(pode ser acionado 2 vezes)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_es = "#C0x5c9970#Mejora furtiva de fantasma: brinda protección cuando hay un aliado de tipo fantasma en el campo. El ataque ignora el efecto del terreno. [Phantasm Backstab] la proporción aumenta al 500%, cuando te disfrazas de la sombra del enemigo, puedes obtener algún beneficio del enemigo.",
		describe_th = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#คุณจะได้รับคำสาปอันชั่วร้ายของฉันเสมอ#C0x5B545B#
