		simDesc_kr = "오리진 뮤는 적 전체를 공격해 피해를 주고, [Gene Modification] 적의 무작위 적을 초에너지형으로 변신[Single Ovum Cell Ball] 과 동시에 필드에 있는 추가 소환물체를 제거합니다.",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = "โอกาส 25% ที่จะเปลี่ยนศัตรูเพิ่มเติมเป็น [Single Ovum Ball]; หลังจากรอบการเคลื่อนไหวพิเศษ ความน่าจะเป็นในการปรับรูปร่างมิวทูจะเพิ่มขึ้นอีก 30% ท่าพิเศษนี้แปลงร่าง [Single Ovum Ball]จะเพิ่มขีดจำกัดชีวิตของเพื่อนร่วมทีมที่เป็นมิตร 1 คน 20% เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ (ให้ความสำคัญกับเพื่อนร่วมทีมที่ไม่ได้อยู่ใน [Single Ovum Ball] ของระบบพลังงานพิเศษ)",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_kr = "추가 적을 [Single Ovum Ball]로 바꿀 확률 25%; 특별 이동 라운드 후에는 뮤츠를 재편성할 확률이 추가로 30% 증가합니다. 이 특별한 움직임은 하나를 변화시킵니다 [Single Ovum Ball]아군 팀원 1명의 생명 제한을 2라운드 동안 20% 증가시킵니다. (슈퍼 에너지 시스템의 [Single Ovum Ball]에 속하지 않은 팀원에게 우선권이 주어집니다)",
		starEffectDesc_en = "Additional effect: When there are other super teammates on the field, there is a 50% chance to turn an enemy into a [Single Ovum Ball] for 1 round; [Single Ovum Ball] has the effect of [Life Exhaustion]: those connected to the [Single Ovum Ball]The final damage reduction and apportionment effect of the life link will be invalid for a short time, and 30% of the damage received by [Single Ovum Ball] will be transferred to other units in the link; 10% of the target's HP will be deducted immediately, and a singleBefore the egg cell acts, the blood volume of 5% of the upper limit of life is deducted each time",
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = "25% de chance de transformar um inimigo adicional em [Single Ovum Ball]; após a rodada de movimento especial, a probabilidade de remodelar Mewtwo aumenta em mais 30%; este movimento especial transforma um [Single Ovum Ball]Aumentará o limite de vida de 1 companheiro de equipe amigável em 20% por 2 rodadas (a prioridade é dada aos companheiros de equipe que não estão no [Single Ovum Ball] do sistema de superenergia)",
