		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = "#C0x5c9970#When Shiny Mega Gallade and Shiny Mega Gardevoir are in battle at the same time, the former will set a [Thorn Trap] on the target the first time it attacks in each round and will immediately gain 1000 Fighting Spirit when receiving fatal DMG; when the latter dies, the former will permanently increase the DMG bonus by 30% and immediately releases an Ult Skill. The knight summoned by the latter will inherit an additional 30% of the attributes of the former",
		starEffectDesc_es = "Al recibir DAÑO fatal, se obtienen inmediatamente 500 Fighting Spirit y se retiene 1 HP; durante este período, HP y Fighting Spirit ya no se pueden obtener de ninguna forma. Al recibir DAÑO, se deducirá la proporción correspondiente de Fighting Spirit (se pueden deducir hasta 100 Fighting Spirit durante la ronda de acción de una unidad). Será derrotado cuando el espíritu de lucha se agote.",
