		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Mew unleashes its Miracle Eye and gathers a great energy to attack a single enemy target, dealing#C0x3D8A99#560% SP.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#SP.DMG#C0x5B545B#, temporarily increases the attack's 20% Crit Rate and Crit DMG, and gains a Light Shield for 2 rounds (absorbs 50% of Ultimate skill damage). When having Light Shield, increase itself with 40% negative effect Resist and Immunity to Control , when breaking Light Shield deals damage equals to light sheild HP(This damage able to crit)",
