		simDesc_th = "Wynaut ใช้กระจกสะท้อนพลังงานโจมตีศัตรูเป้าหมายเดียว สร้างความเสียหายพิเศษ รักษาตัวเอง และเพิ่มอัตราการเด้งกลับ",
		zawakeEffectDesc_es = "Wynaut usa el espejo para reflejar energía para atacar al único objetivo del enemigo, causando #C0xF13B54#daño especial#C0x5B545B# de #C0x3D8A99#150% de ataque especial #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$, y cura el 100% de su límite de vida y aumenta 100. % de tasa de rebote durante 2 rondas, y luego agrega [Stepping Shadow] durante 3 rondas a una unidad enemiga aleatoria cuyo límite superior de vida es menor que ella misma\n#F20#\n#F40#【Stepping Shadow】: efecto negativo especial, no permitidoCuando se disipa, el efecto curativo recibido se reduce en un 70% y el daño reflejado recibido aumenta en un 100%.",
		starEffectDesc_kr = "추가 효과 : 궁극기 스킬로 발생하는 힐링 오버플로가 동일한 생명력 상한치로 영구적으로 변환됩니다. (상한치는 3레이어입니다.)",
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = "Wynaut uses the mirror to reflect energy to attack the enemy's single target, causing #C0xF13B54#special damage#C0x5B545B# of #C0x3D8A99#150% special attack #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$, and heals 100% of his life limitLife and increase 100% rebound rate for 2 rounds, and then add [Stepping Shadow] for 3 rounds to a random enemy unit whose upper limit of life is lower than itself\n#F20#\n#F40#【Stepping Shadow】: special negative effect, not allowedWhen dispelled, the healing effect received is reduced by 70%, and the reflected damage received is increased by 100%.",
